const baseline={"calc-limit-0001":{"id":"calc-limit-0001","topic":0,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"设 $x\\to 0$，则极限 $\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{e^x-1-x}{x^2}$ 的值为：","options":["$0$","$\\frac{1}{2}$","$1$","$不存在$"],"answer":1,"hint":"先判断类型：$x\\to0$ 时分子 $e^x-1-x\\to0$，是 $\\frac00$ 型。观察 $e^x$ 在 0 附近与 $1+x$ 的低阶项会相互抵消，所以要把 $e^x$ 展开到二阶，才能看出分子的非零主导项。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：这是 $\\frac00$ 型未定式。分子 $e^x-1-x$ 中，$e^x$ 的常数项与一次项分别和 $1$、$x$ 抵消，直接代入或只用一次洛必达仍无法定出极限，必须展开到二阶（或连续用两次洛必达）才能暴露分子的非零主导项，从而与分母 $x^2$ 比较。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>在 $x=0$ 处作泰勒展开：$e^x=1+x+\\frac{x^2}{2}+o(x^2)$。依据：$e^x$ 在 0 处任意阶可导，泰勒公式成立，且这里展开到二阶已足够。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>代入分子并合并同类项：$e^x-1-x=\\left(1+x+\\frac{x^2}{2}+o(x^2)\\right)-1-x=\\frac{x^2}{2}+o(x^2)$。常数项 $1-1$ 与一次项 $x-x$ 恰好抵消，二阶项 $\\frac{x^2}{2}$ 成为主导项。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>分子、分母同除以 $x^2$：$\\frac{e^x-1-x}{x^2}=\\frac12+\\frac{o(x^2)}{x^2}=\\frac12+o(1)$。令 $x\\to0$，$o(1)\\to0$，故极限为 $\\frac12$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：只把 $e^x$ 展开到 $e^x=1+x+o(x)$，则分子只剩 $o(x)$，无法判断 $\\frac{o(x)}{x^2}$ 的极限，会误以为极限为 0 或不存在。务必展开到「能抵消的最低阶项」之后的下一阶。若改用洛必达，需连续两次，并注意每一步都仍是 $\\frac00$ 型、条件成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\frac{1}{2}$。</div></div>","knowledge":"泰勒展开与等价无穷小","knowledgeTags":["泰勒展开与等价无穷小"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["函数基本性质","基本极限"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t0-06"},"calc-continuity-0001":{"id":"calc-continuity-0001","topic":0,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"函数 $f(x)=\\frac{|x|}{x}$ 在 $x=0$ 处：","options":["连续","可去间断","跳跃间断","无穷间断"],"answer":2,"hint":"绝对值要先按 $x>0$ 与 $x<0$ 拆成两段分别化简，再分别求左右极限并比较。判断间断类型的关键就是「左右极限是否都存在、是否相等」。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：含绝对值的函数需先分段化简。间断点的分类依据是左、右极限的存在性与是否相等：都存在且相等则为可去间断（或连续），都存在但不相等为跳跃间断，至少一侧为无穷为无穷间断。因此本题先分别算 $x\\to0^+$ 与 $x\\to0^-$ 两个单侧极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>当 $x>0$ 时 $|x|=x$，故 $f(x)=\\frac{x}{x}=1$，于是右极限 $\\lim_{x\\to0^+}f(x)=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>当 $x<0$ 时 $|x|=-x$，故 $f(x)=\\frac{-x}{x}=-1$，于是左极限 $\\lim_{x\\to0^-}f(x)=-1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>左、右极限都存在但 $1\\ne-1$，故 $\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)$ 不存在；又两侧均为有限值，按定义 $x=0$ 是跳跃间断点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：不要直接写「$|x|/x=\\pm1$，无定义所以是无穷间断」——函数值虽然无定义，但两侧极限都有限，属于跳跃而非无穷间断。区分「函数在某点无定义」与「该点两侧极限的性态」是判断间断类型的关键。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：跳跃间断。</div></div>","knowledge":"函数间断点分类","knowledgeTags":["函数间断点分类"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["函数基本性质","基本极限"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t0-09"},"calc-continuity-0002":{"id":"calc-continuity-0002","topic":0,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"若 $f(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 连续，且 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}=2$，则 $f(0)$ 等于：","options":["$0$","$1$","$2$","无法确定"],"answer":0,"hint":"已知的是 $\\frac{f(x)}{x}$ 的极限，想求 $f(0)$。把 $f(x)$ 写成 $x$ 与已知商的乘积，再用极限乘法法则；最后用「连续」把极限值翻译成函数值。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：条件给的是商 $\\frac{f(x)}{x}$ 的极限，而要求 $f(0)$。思路是把 $f(x)$ 表示成已知信息与已知极限因子的乘积：$f(x)=x\\cdot\\frac{f(x)}{x}$，再用极限乘法法则求出 $\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)$，最后由连续性把极限值转化为函数值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>写出恒等变形 $f(x)=x\\cdot\\frac{f(x)}{x}$。已知 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}=2$（有限值），且 $\\lim_{x\\to0}x=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由极限乘法法则（两个因子极限都存在时，乘积的极限等于极限的乘积）：$\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=\\left(\\lim_{x\\to0}x\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}\\right)=0\\cdot2=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>因 $f$ 在 $x=0$ 连续，按连续性定义 $f(0)=\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：不能由 $\\lim\\frac{f(x)}x=2$ 直接断言 $f(0)=2$，也不能把极限里的 $f(x)$ 直接替换成 $f(0)$（连续性只保证 $f(x)\\to f(0)$，不保证 $f(0)=2$）。核心是把条件改写成可拆分的乘积形式再取极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$f(0)=0$。</div></div>","knowledge":"连续性与极限","knowledgeTags":["连续性与极限"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["函数基本性质","基本极限"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t0-01"},"calc-differential-0001":{"id":"calc-differential-0001","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"函数 $f(x)=x^3-3x$ 在区间 $[-2,2]$ 上的最大值与最小值分别为：","options":["$2$ 与 $-2$","$4$ 与 $-4$","$2$ 与 $-4$","$4$ 与 $-2$"],"answer":0,"hint":"闭区间上的连续函数，最值只会出现在「区间端点」或「内部驻点（$f'(x)=0$）」。先求出所有驻点，再把驻点值与两个端点值放一起比较，最大者即最大值、最小者即最小值。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：这是闭区间最值问题。连续函数在闭区间 $[a,b]$ 上必有最大、最小值（最值定理），且极值只能出现在端点和内部驻点（$f'=0$ 的点）处。因此「列出候选点 → 逐一求函数值 → 比较」即可，无需判断凹凸性。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>求导：$f'(x)=3x^2-3=3(x-1)(x+1)$。令 $f'(x)=0$ 得区间内驻点 $x=-1$ 与 $x=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>计算全部候选点的函数值：$f(-2)=-8+6=-2$，$f(-1)=-1+3=2$，$f(1)=1-3=-2$，$f(2)=8-6=2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>比较四个值 $\\{-2,2,-2,2\\}$：最大值为 $2$，最小值为 $-2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：只算驻点而漏掉端点，会误判（这里若只看驻点会得最大 $2$、最小 $-2$ 恰好没漏，但换题就可能出错）；更常见的是把 $x=\\pm1$ 代入后的 $f$ 值算错符号。务必把端点与驻点都纳入比较。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：最大值为 $2$，最小值为 $-2$。</div></div>","knowledge":"闭区间最值","knowledgeTags":["闭区间最值"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["导数定义","一元函数连续性"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t1-07"},"calc-differential-0002":{"id":"calc-differential-0002","topic":1,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"若 $y=\\ln(1+x^2)$，则 $y'(x)$ 等于：","options":["$\\frac{1}{1+x^2}$","$\\frac{2x}{1+x^2}$","$2x\\ln(1+x^2)$","$\\frac{2}{1+x^2}$"],"answer":1,"hint":"这是复合函数：外层是对数、内层是 $1+x^2$。按链式法则「先对外层求导、再乘以内层导数」分两步，别忘内层 $1+x^2$ 的导数是 $2x$。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：$y=\\ln(1+x^2)$ 是复合函数，由链式法则 $y'=f'(u)\\cdot u'$（外层对数求导乘以内层导数）。关键是先识别内层函数 $u=1+x^2$，再逐层求导，避免漏掉内层因子。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>设 $u=1+x^2$，则 $y=\\ln u$。由对数求导公式 $(\\ln u)'=\\frac{u'}{u}=\\frac{1}{u}\\cdot u'$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>求内层导数 $u'=(1+x^2)'=2x$。代入得 $y'=\\frac{1}{1+x^2}\\cdot2x=\\frac{2x}{1+x^2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最常见的错误是只写 $y'=\\frac{1}{1+x^2}$，漏乘内层导数 $2x$。判断口诀：凡是对数里不是一个「裸 $x$」而是含 $x$ 的式子，就必须乘上该式子的导数。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\frac{2x}{1+x^2}$。</div></div>","knowledge":"复合函数求导","knowledgeTags":["复合函数求导"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["导数定义","一元函数连续性"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t1-02"},"calc-integral-0001":{"id":"calc-integral-0001","topic":2,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 2x e^{x^2}\\,dx$ 的值为：","options":["$e-1$","$e$","$1$","$\\frac{e^2-1}{2}$"],"answer":0,"hint":"观察指数 $x^2$ 的导数 $2x$ 恰好就是前面的因子，这正是换元积分的特征。令 $u=x^2$，同时把 $dx$ 换成 $du$ 并同步更新积分上下限。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：被积函数 $2xe^{x^2}$ 中，$x^2$ 的导数 $2x$ 正好作为因子出现，即被积函数形如 $u'\\cdot e^{u}$，适合用换元积分（凑微分）。定积分换元时必须同时替换上下限，换元后直接算新变量的定积分即可，无需再换回原变量。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>令 $u=x^2$，则 $du=2x\\,dx$。上下限随之变化：$x=0\\Rightarrow u=0$，$x=1\\Rightarrow u=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>代入得 $\\int_0^1 2xe^{x^2}dx=\\int_0^1 e^u\\,du$。依据：$2x\\,dx=du$，且上下限已同步换成 $u$ 的取值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>由 $e^u$ 的原函数为 $e^u$，$\\int_0^1e^u\\,du=[e^u]_0^1=e-1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：忘记换上下限，仍用 $x$ 的 0 到 1 去算 $u$ 的积分，或漏掉 $\\frac12$ 这类系数。换元定积分「上下限必须与积分变量一致」是最容易丢分的地方。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$e-1$。</div></div>","knowledge":"换元积分法","knowledgeTags":["换元积分法"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["原函数与定积分","基本积分公式"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t2-04"},"calc-multivariable-0001":{"id":"calc-multivariable-0001","topic":3,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"函数 $f(x,y)=x^2+xy+y^2$ 在点 $(1,1)$ 处的 $f_x$ 为：","options":["$2$","$3$","$4$","$5$"],"answer":1,"hint":"求 $f_x$ 时把 $y$ 当作常数、只对 $x$ 求导。逐项求：$x^2$、$xy$、$y^2$ 各自对 $x$ 的偏导是多少？最后再把点 $(1,1)$ 代进去。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：偏导数 $f_x$ 是「把 $y$ 固定为常数、只对 $x$ 求导」得到的一元导数。逐项用一元求导规则：含 $x$ 的项正常求导，只含 $y$ 的项（如 $y^2$）对 $x$ 而言是常数、导数为 0。求完偏导函数后再代入给定点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>把 $y$ 视为常数，逐项求偏导：$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}(x^2)=2x$，$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}(xy)=y$（$y$ 作为系数提出），$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}(y^2)=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>合并得 $f_x=2x+y$。代入 $(x,y)=(1,1)$：$f_x(1,1)=2\\cdot1+1=3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：把 $y$ 也当成变量、用乘积法则错算 $xy$ 项（会多出 $\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x}$ 之类项），或误把 $y^2$ 对 $x$ 求导成 $2y$。记住偏导数的「单变量固定」本质，就能避免这些错误。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$f_x(1,1)=3$。</div></div>","knowledge":"偏导数计算","knowledgeTags":["偏导数计算"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["一元函数微分学","偏导数"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t3-01"},"calc-double-integral-0001":{"id":"calc-double-integral-0001","topic":4,"level":"综合","type":"choice","prompt":"将 $\\iint_D f(x,y)\\,dxdy$ 化为极坐标，其中 $D:x^2+y^2\\le a^2$（设 $a>0$），正确的积分区域与面积元素为：","options":["$0\\le r\\le a,\\ 0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$，且 $dxdy=r\\,drd\\theta$","$0\\le r\\le a,\\ 0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi$，且 $dxdy=drd\\theta$","$0\\le r\\le a^2,\\ 0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$，且 $dxdy=r^2\\,drd\\theta$","$0\\le r\\le a,\\ -\\pi\\le\\theta\\le\\pi/2$，且 $dxdy=r\\,drd\\theta$"],"answer":0,"hint":"先由 $x^2+y^2=r^2$ 把圆盘条件写成 $r$ 的范围（注意 $r\\ge0$）；再看圆盘是否覆盖整周以确定 $\\theta$ 范围；最后检查极坐标变换的雅可比因子，它决定面积元素是 $r\\,drd\\theta$ 还是别的。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：极坐标变换 $x=r\\cos\\theta,\\ y=r\\sin\\theta$ 下，圆盘 $x^2+y^2\\le a^2$ 变成 $r^2\\le a^2$。因极径 $r\\ge0$，故 $0\\le r\\le a$；圆盘关于原点整周对称，故 $\\theta$ 取满一周 $[0,2\\pi]$。面积元素由雅可比行列式决定，需单独计算。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>由 $x^2+y^2=r^2(\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta)=r^2$，圆盘条件化为 $r^2\\le a^2$，结合 $r\\ge0$ 得 $0\\le r\\le a$。角度无任何限制，取 $0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$ 覆盖整周。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>计算雅可比：$J=\\frac{\\partial(x,y)}{\\partial(r,\\theta)}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\cos\\theta&-r\\sin\\theta\\\\ \\sin\\theta&r\\cos\\theta\\end{vmatrix}=r$。所以面积元素 $dxdy=|J|\\,drd\\theta=r\\,drd\\theta$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>因此积分化为 $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^a f(r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)\\,r\\,drd\\theta$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两处高频错误——一是把 $r$ 的范围写成 $r\\le a^2$ 或允许 $r$ 取负；二是漏掉雅可比因子 $r$，把 $dxdy$ 直接写成 $drd\\theta$。漏 $r$ 是极坐标二重积分最常见的失分点，务必牢记 $dxdy=r\\,drd\\theta$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$0\\le r\\le a$，$0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$，面积元素为 $r\\,drd\\theta$。</div></div>","knowledge":"极坐标与区域表示","knowledgeTags":["极坐标与区域表示"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":5,"prerequisites":["二重积分定义","二元函数基础"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t4-05"},"calc-ode-0001":{"id":"calc-ode-0001","topic":5,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"微分方程 $y'=2xy$ 的通解为：","options":["$y=Ce^{x^2}$","$y=C+ x^2$","$y=Cx^2$","$y=Ce^{2x}$"],"answer":0,"hint":"这是可分离变量方程。先分离变量把 $y$ 与 $x$ 分到等号两边，再分别积分；最后记得检查分离变量时被「除以」的零解 $y=0$ 是否已包含在通解中。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：方程 $y'=2xy$ 可写成 $y'=g(x)\\cdot h(y)$ 的形式，是可分离变量方程。标准解法是「分离变量 → 两边积分 → 用任意常数表示通解」。注意分离变量时两边除以 $y$，会暂时丢掉 $y=0$ 的解，最后要单独检查并把它并回通解。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>先求非零解：分离变量得 $\\frac{dy}{y}=2x\\,dx$（此处假设 $y\\ne0$）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>两边积分：$\\ln|y|=x^2+C_1$。两边取指数得 $|y|=e^{C_1}e^{x^2}$，把正负号并入任意常数，得 $y=Ce^{x^2}$（$C\\ne0$）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>检查零解：$y\\equiv0$ 代入原方程 $y'=0=2x\\cdot0$ 成立。取 $C=0$ 时通解 $y=Ce^{x^2}$ 恰好覆盖零解，故通解为 $y=Ce^{x^2}$，$C$ 为任意常数。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：积分后只写 $\\ln y=x^2+C$ 而忘记绝对值，或把 $e^{x^2}$ 误写成 $e^{2x}$、把积分结果写成 $x^2$（漏指数化）。另外分离变量时若直接除以 $y$，务必补回 $y=0$ 的解。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$y=Ce^{x^2}$，其中 $C$ 为任意常数。</div></div>","knowledge":"可分离变量方程","knowledgeTags":["可分离变量方程"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"常微分方程","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["一元函数积分学","导数与积分"],"source":{"kind":"项目既有题","reference":"阶段一/二题库","license":"项目自有题库"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"kpId":"kp-t5-02"},"calc-limit-0002":{"id":"calc-limit-0002","topic":0,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"极限 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sqrt{1+4x}-1}{x}$ 等于：","options":["$1$","$2$","$4$","$不存在$"],"answer":1,"hint":"分子是两根号之差，属于 $\\frac00$ 型。对付「根式相减」的标准手段是分子分母同乘共轭式（分子两项之和），用平方差公式消去根号，再化简求极限。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：当 $x\\to0$ 时分子 $\\sqrt{1+4x}-1\\to0$，是 $\\frac00$ 型。根式差的极限，通用做法是有理化：分子分母同乘共轭式 $\\sqrt{1+4x}+1$，利用平方差 $(\\sqrt a-1)(\\sqrt a+1)=a-1$ 消去根号，从而消除未定式。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>分子分母同乘 $\\sqrt{1+4x}+1$：$\\frac{\\sqrt{1+4x}-1}{x}=\\frac{(\\sqrt{1+4x}-1)(\\sqrt{1+4x}+1)}{x(\\sqrt{1+4x}+1)}=\\frac{(1+4x)-1}{x(\\sqrt{1+4x}+1)}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>化简分子 $(1+4x)-1=4x$，约去 $x$ 得 $\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1+4x}+1}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>令 $x\\to0$，$\\sqrt{1+4x}\\to1$，故分母趋于 $2$，极限为 $\\frac{4}{2}=2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：只对分子乘共轭而分母不同乘（等式不成立），或化简时把 $4x$ 约成 $4$ 却忘了分母还乘了共轭。有理化必须分子分母同乘同一非零式，保证恒等变形。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$2$。</div></div>","knowledge":"根式极限与有理化","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"OpenStax Calculus Volume 1 §2.3 极限运算法则与根式有理化题型","license":"原创题干与数据，仅借鉴公开教材的方法类型"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"knowledgeTags":["根式极限与有理化"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["函数基本性质","基本极限"],"kpId":"kp-t0-04"},"calc-limit-0003":{"id":"calc-limit-0003","topic":0,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"极限 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{x}$ 等于：","options":["$\\frac{1}{3}$","$1$","$3$","$0$"],"answer":2,"hint":"标准的基本极限是 $\\lim_{u\\to0}\\frac{\\sin u}{u}=1$，注意分子分母的「角度」必须一致。这里分子是 $\\sin(3x)$、分母是 $x$，可把分母凑成 $3x$，并把多出的比例系数提出。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：第一重要极限 $\\lim_{u\\to0}\\frac{\\sin u}{u}=1$ 要求分子里的角度与分母完全相同。本题分子角度是 $3x$ 而分母是 $x$，需做恒等变形把分式改写成 $\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{3x}$ 的倍数，再套基本极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>凑形式：$\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{x}=3\\cdot\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{3x}$。依据：分子分母同乘 $3$ 再提出常数 $3$，恒等变形不改变极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>令 $u=3x$，则当 $x\\to0$ 时 $u\\to0$，且 $\\lim_{u\\to0}\\frac{\\sin u}{u}=1$。故原极限 $=3\\cdot1=3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：直接把 $\\frac{\\sin(3x)}x$ 当 $1$，漏掉系数 $3$。判断标准：只有当分子角与分母完全一致时才等于 1；不一致时必须先凑成一致并提取比例因子。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：极限为 $3$。</div></div>","knowledge":"第一重要极限","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"OpenStax Calculus Volume 1 §2.3 三角函数基本极限题型","license":"原创题干与数据，仅借鉴公开教材的方法类型"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"knowledgeTags":["第一重要极限"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["函数基本性质","基本极限"],"kpId":"kp-t0-05"},"calc-differential-0003":{"id":"calc-differential-0003","topic":1,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"曲线 $y=x^2+1$ 在点 $(1,2)$ 处的切线方程是：","options":["$y=x+1$","$y=2x$","$y=2x+1$","$y=x+2$"],"answer":1,"hint":"切线方程的斜率就是导函数在切点横坐标处的值。先求 $y'$ 并代入 $x=1$ 得到斜率，再用「点斜式」$y-y_0=k(x-x_0)$ 写出直线，最后可代入切点验证。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：导数在几何上表示切线的斜率，$y'(x_0)$ 即曲线在 $x=x_0$ 处切线的斜率。因此「求导 → 代点得斜率 → 点斜式」是求切线方程的标准三步。切点 $(1,2)$ 同时满足曲线与切线方程，可作为自检。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>求导：$y'=2x$。在 $x=1$ 处切线斜率 $k=y'(1)=2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>用点斜式：$y-2=2(x-1)$，整理得 $y=2x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>验证：切点 $(1,2)$ 代入 $y=2x$ 得 $2=2\\cdot1$，成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：把 $y'=2x$ 直接当成切线方程写 $y=2x$（此例恰巧正确，但一般切线是 $y-y_0=y'(x_0)(x-x_0)$，不能漏掉过点的平移）；或点斜式符号弄错写成 $y-2=2(x+1)$。牢记点斜式 $y-y_0=k(x-x_0)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$y=2x$。</div></div>","knowledge":"导数几何意义与切线","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"OpenStax Calculus Volume 1 §3.1 导数定义与切线斜率","license":"原创题干与数据，仅借鉴公开教材的方法类型"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"knowledgeTags":["导数几何意义与切线"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["导数定义","一元函数连续性"],"kpId":"kp-t1-06"},"calc-differential-0004":{"id":"calc-differential-0004","topic":1,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"矩形场地周长为 $20$ 米，长、宽均为正数。其面积的最大值为：","options":["$20\\text{ 平方米}$","$24\\text{ 平方米}$","$25\\text{ 平方米}$","$100\\text{ 平方米}$"],"answer":2,"hint":"先用周长条件把一个变量表示成另一个（如 $x+y=10$），把面积写成单变量函数 $A(x)$。然后求导找驻点，并判断该驻点是否确实给出最大值（可用二阶导或区间端点比较）。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：这是优化应用题。关键是把「两个变量 + 一个约束」化成「单变量函数求最值」：用周长约束消去一个变量，写出面积函数 $A(x)$，确定自变量范围，再求导找极值并验证。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>设长为 $x$、宽为 $y$，由周长 $2(x+y)=20$ 得 $x+y=10$，即 $y=10-x$。因长宽为正，自变量范围 $0<x<10$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>面积 $A(x)=xy=x(10-x)=10x-x^2$。求导 $A'(x)=10-2x$，令 $A'(x)=0$ 得驻点 $x=5$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>判断最大值：$A''(x)=-2<0$，故 $x=5$ 处为最大值；此时 $y=5$，最大面积 $A=25$。端点 $x\\to0^+$ 或 $x\\to10^-$ 时面积趋于 $0$，印证这是全局最大。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：求导后不验证极值性质就直接报答案，或误认为「周长 $20$ 对应的正方形边长是 $20/4=5$」之外的其它值更大。本题隐含结论：定周长矩形中正方形面积最大，可用 $A''<0$ 严格说明。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$25$ 平方米。</div></div>","knowledge":"一元函数最值与优化","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"OpenStax Calculus Volume 1 §4.7 应用优化问题","license":"原创情境、题干与数据，仅借鉴公开教材的方法类型"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"knowledgeTags":["一元函数最值与优化"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["导数定义","一元函数连续性"],"kpId":"kp-t1-08"},"calc-integral-0002":{"id":"calc-integral-0002","topic":2,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"定积分 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 xe^x\\,dx$ 的值为：","options":["$0$","$1$","$e-1$","$e$"],"answer":1,"hint":"被积函数是「多项式 $x$」与「指数 $e^x$」的乘积，适合分部积分。选择 $u=x$（求导后变简单）、$dv=e^x dx$（容易积出 $v$），套公式 $\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：乘积型被积函数 $xe^x$ 没有直接的基本积分公式，用分部积分 $\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$。选择原则是「求导后更简单」的因子作 $u$、能直接积出的作 $dv$：这里 $x$ 求导得 $1$（变简单），$e^x$ 积分仍为 $e^x$，故取 $u=x$、$dv=e^x dx$。定积分分部积分时边界项 $[uv]$ 也要一起代入上下限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>取 $u=x,\\ dv=e^x dx$，则 $du=dx,\\ v=e^x$。由分部积分：$\\int_0^1xe^x dx=[xe^x]_0^1-\\int_0^1e^x dx$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>计算边界项 $[xe^x]_0^1=1\\cdot e-0=e$，及 $\\int_0^1e^x dx=[e^x]_0^1=e-1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>代入：原积分 $=e-(e-1)=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：$u$、$dv$ 选反（取 $u=e^x$）会让积分越来越复杂；或做定积分时漏算边界项 $[uv]_0^1$。另外注意 $[xe^x]_0^1=e$（不是 $0$），这是结果从 $e$ 减成 $1$ 的关键。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$1$。</div></div>","knowledge":"定积分分部积分法","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"MIT OCW 18.01SC Problem Set 10 分部积分题型；OpenStax 积分方法","license":"原创题干与数据，未复制课程原题"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"knowledgeTags":["定积分分部积分法"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["原函数与定积分","基本积分公式"],"kpId":"kp-t2-05"},"calc-integral-0003":{"id":"calc-integral-0003","topic":2,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"计算 $\\displaystyle\\int_{-1}^{1}(x^3+\\cos x)\\,dx$，结果为：","options":["$0$","$2\\sin1$","$2+2\\sin1$","$2\\cos1$"],"answer":1,"hint":"先分别判断 $x^3$ 与 $\\cos x$ 在关于原点对称区间上的奇偶性。奇函数在 $[-a,a]$ 上的积分为 0；偶函数则等于 $2\\int_0^a$。再对偶函数部分正常积分即可。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：区间 $[-1,1]$ 关于原点对称，应优先利用奇偶函数的定积分性质：奇函数 $g(-x)=-g(x)$ 在对称区间上积分为 0；偶函数 $h(-x)=h(x)$ 满足 $\\int_{-a}^a h=2\\int_0^a h$。分别识别两项的奇偶性，可大大简化计算。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$x^3$ 满足 $(-x)^3=-x^3$，是奇函数，故 $\\int_{-1}^1x^3dx=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>$\\cos x$ 满足 $\\cos(-x)=\\cos x$，是偶函数，故 $\\int_{-1}^1\\cos x\\,dx=2\\int_0^1\\cos x\\,dx=2[\\sin x]_0^1=2\\sin1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>两者相加：$\\int_{-1}^1(x^3+\\cos x)dx=0+2\\sin1=2\\sin1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：不加判断地直接求 $x^3+\\cos x$ 的原函数并代入，虽然也能算对但更费时且易错；更常见的是把 $\\cos x$ 也当成奇函数（误得 0），或把 $x^3$ 的积分误算为非零。奇偶性判断务必核对定义。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$2\\sin1$。</div></div>","knowledge":"奇偶函数的定积分性质","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"OpenStax Calculus Volume 1 §5.4 积分公式与奇偶函数定积分性质","license":"原创题干与数据，仅借鉴公开教材的方法类型"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"knowledgeTags":["奇偶函数的定积分性质"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["原函数与定积分","基本积分公式"],"kpId":"kp-t2-06"},"calc-integral-0004":{"id":"calc-integral-0004","topic":2,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"反常积分 $\\displaystyle\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^p}\\,dx$ 收敛的条件是：","options":["$p<0$","$p\\le1$","$p>1$","对所有实数 $p$ 均收敛"],"answer":2,"hint":"先把上限换成有限数 $R$ 算定积分，再令 $R\\to+\\infty$ 看极限是否有限。注意 $p=1$ 时原函数是 $\\ln x$ 而不是幂函数，必须单独讨论。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：这是 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}x^{-p}dx$ 的幂函数反常积分。判敛方法是「先算有限上限、再取极限」：对 $p\\ne1$ 用幂函数积分公式求 $\\int_1^R x^{-p}dx$，令 $R\\to+\\infty$ 观察 $R^{1-p}$ 的极限；$p=1$ 时原函数为对数，需单独处理。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>当 $p\\ne1$：$\\int_1^R x^{-p}dx=\\left[\\frac{x^{1-p}}{1-p}\\right]_1^R=\\frac{R^{1-p}-1}{1-p}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>令 $R\\to+\\infty$：若 $p>1$，则 $1-p<0$，$R^{1-p}\\to0$，积分收敛于 $\\frac{1}{p-1}$；若 $p<1$，则 $1-p>0$，$R^{1-p}\\to+\\infty$，积分发散。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>当 $p=1$：$\\int_1^R \\frac1x dx=[\\ln x]_1^R=\\ln R\\to+\\infty$，发散。综上，收敛当且仅当 $p>1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：忘记 $p=1$ 的临界情形（此时是 $\\ln$ 发散而非幂函数）；或把收敛条件记反成 $p<1$。判断口诀：$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^p}dx$ 当 $p>1$ 收敛、$p\\le1$ 发散，是考研高频结论，务必记准。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$p>1$。</div></div>","knowledge":"反常积分敛散判别","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"OpenStax Calculus Volume 2 §3.7 Improper Integrals 反常积分幂函数判敛题型","license":"原创题干与数据，仅借鉴公开教材的方法类型"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"knowledgeTags":["反常积分敛散判别"],"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["原函数与定积分","基本积分公式"],"kpId":"kp-t2-08"},"calc-stage3-limit-0001":{"id":"calc-stage3-limit-0001","topic":0,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"若 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)-2}{x}=3$，则 $f(0)$ 等于：","options":["$0$","$2$","$3$","无法确定"],"answer":3,"knowledge":"极限与函数值","hint":"把分子写成 $f(x)-f(0)$ 的形式，比较差商定义；先判断题目是否给出了连续条件。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div>围绕“极限与函数值”识别题型，先写出适用定义或公式，再完成化简。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>题目没有说明 $f$ 在 $0$ 处连续，差商极限只描述趋近过程。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>因此不能由该极限直接确定 $f(0)$，正确选项应为“无法确定”。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div>注意条件、系数和最后一步的代入，避免只凭结论记忆。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：无法确定。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"本项目阶段三原创题","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["函数连续性"],"knowledgeTags":["极限与函数值"],"kpId":"kp-t0-02"},"calc-stage3-differential-0001":{"id":"calc-stage3-differential-0001","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"若 $f'(x)=2x\\cos(x^2)$，且 $f(0)=1$，则 $f(1)$ 等于：","options":["$1$","$sin1$","$1+sin1$","$2$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"导数与积分的联系","hint":"观察 $2x\\cos(x^2)$ 是 $\\sin(x^2)$ 的导数，先求一个原函数，再用初值确定常数。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div>围绕“导数与积分的联系”识别题型，先写出适用定义或公式，再完成化简。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$\\int2x\\cos(x^2)dx=\\sin(x^2)+C$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由 $f(0)=1$ 得 $C=1$，所以 $f(1)=\\sin1+1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div>注意条件、系数和最后一步的代入，避免只凭结论记忆。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$1+sin1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"本项目阶段三原创题","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["导数与积分基本定理"],"knowledgeTags":["导数与积分的联系"],"kpId":"kp-t1-09"},"calc-stage3-integral-0001":{"id":"calc-stage3-integral-0001","topic":2,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\frac{1}{1+x}\\,dx$ 的值为：","options":["$ln2$","$1$","$2$","$e-1$"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"对数型积分","hint":"被积函数是 $\\frac{u'}u$ 型，直接使用 $\\int\\frac{u'}u dx=\\ln|u|+C$，再代入上下限。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div>围绕“对数型积分”识别题型，先写出适用定义或公式，再完成化简。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>原函数为 $\\ln(1+x)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>代入上下限得 $\\ln2-\\ln1=\\ln2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div>注意条件、系数和最后一步的代入，避免只凭结论记忆。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$ln2$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"本项目阶段三原创题","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["基本积分公式"],"knowledgeTags":["对数型积分"],"kpId":"kp-t2-07"},"calc-stage3-multivariable-0001":{"id":"calc-stage3-multivariable-0001","topic":3,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"函数 $f(x,y)=x^2+2y^2$ 在 $(1,1)$ 处的方向导数最大值为：","options":["$2$","$4$","$sqrt{20}$","$20$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"梯度与方向导数","hint":"方向导数的最大值等于梯度的模。先求梯度，再在给定点代入并求模。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div>围绕“梯度与方向导数”识别题型，先写出适用定义或公式，再完成化简。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$\\nabla f=(2x,4y)$，故 $\\nabla f(1,1)=(2,4)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>最大方向导数为 $|\\nabla f|=\\sqrt{2^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{20}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div>注意条件、系数和最后一步的代入，避免只凭结论记忆。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$sqrt{20}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"本项目阶段三原创题","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["偏导数","梯度"],"knowledgeTags":["梯度与方向导数"],"kpId":"kp-t3-05"},"calc-stage3-double-integral-0001":{"id":"calc-stage3-double-integral-0001","topic":4,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"单位圆盘 $D$ 上 $\\displaystyle\\iint_D1\\,dA$ 等于：","options":["$1$","$pi$","$2pi$","$4pi$"],"answer":1,"knowledge":"二重积分的几何意义","hint":"被积函数为 1，二重积分就是区域面积；单位圆的半径为 1。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div>围绕“二重积分的几何意义”识别题型，先写出适用定义或公式，再完成化简。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$\\iint_D1\\,dA$ 表示区域 $D$ 的面积。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>单位圆面积为 $\\pi\\cdot1^2=\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div>注意条件、系数和最后一步的代入，避免只凭结论记忆。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$pi$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"本项目阶段三原创题","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["二重积分定义","极坐标"],"knowledgeTags":["二重积分的几何意义"],"kpId":"kp-t4-02"},"calc-stage3-ode-0001":{"id":"calc-stage3-ode-0001","topic":5,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"初值问题 $y'+y=0,\\ y(0)=2$ 的解为：","options":["$2e^{-x}$","$2e^x$","$e^{-2x}$","$2-x$"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"一阶线性微分方程","hint":"这是 $y'=-y$ 的指数衰减方程，先写通解 $y=Ce^{-x}$，再代入初值。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div>围绕“一阶线性微分方程”识别题型，先写出适用定义或公式，再完成化简。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$y'+y=0$ 即 $y'=-y$，通解为 $y=Ce^{-x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由 $y(0)=C=2$，得到 $y=2e^{-x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div>注意条件、系数和最后一步的代入，避免只凭结论记忆。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$2e^{-x}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创变式","reference":"本项目阶段三原创题","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-11"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"常微分方程","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["一阶方程通解","初值条件"],"knowledgeTags":["一阶线性微分方程"],"kpId":"kp-t5-03"},"calc-orig-t6-01":{"id":"calc-orig-t6-01","topic":6,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"设向量 $\\vec a=(2,-1,2)$，则与 $\\vec a$ 同方向的单位向量是：","options":["$(2,-1,2)$","$\\left(\\frac29,-\\frac19,\\frac29\\right)$","$\\left(\\frac23,-\\frac13,\\frac23\\right)$","$\\left(\\frac23,\\frac13,\\frac23\\right)$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"向量及其线性运算","hint":"单位向量要与原向量同方向、模为 1：先算原向量的模，再把每个分量都除以这个模。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：单位向量的定义是「与原向量同方向、模为 1」。它由原向量唯一确定，求法只有一步：把原向量除以自身的模。先求模，再逐分量相除，不需要任何附加条件。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$|\\vec a|=\\sqrt{2^{2}+(-1)^{2}+2^{2}}=\\sqrt{9}=3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>故与 $\\vec a$ 同方向的单位向量为 $\\dfrac{\\vec a}{|\\vec a|}=\\left(\\dfrac23,-\\dfrac13,\\dfrac23\\right)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两处高频错误：一是把「方向余弦的平方和等于 1」误记成「向量的模等于 1」，从而不先求模；二是错用分量平方和（这里等于 9）作分母，得到 $\\left(\\frac29,-\\frac19,\\frac29\\right)$ 这种结果。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\left(\\frac23,-\\frac13,\\frac23\\right)$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"向量代数和空间解析几何","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["平面向量与立体几何"],"knowledgeTags":["向量及其线性运算"],"kpId":"kp-t6-01"},"calc-orig-t6-02":{"id":"calc-orig-t6-02","topic":6,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"设 $\\vec a=(1,0,2)$，$\\vec b=(0,1,-1)$，则 $\\vec a\\times\\vec b=$","options":["$(2,-1,-1)$","$(-2,1,1)$","$(-2,-1,1)$","$(2,1,1)$"],"answer":1,"knowledge":"数量积、向量积与混合积","hint":"向量积按三阶行列式展开：第一行是 $\\vec i,\\vec j,\\vec k$，后两行分别是两个向量的坐标。注意展开时 $\\vec j$ 项前带负号。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：求两个三维向量的向量积，固定动作是「写成三阶行列式并按第一行展开」。行列式的三行依次是 $\\vec i,\\vec j,\\vec k$ 和两个向量的坐标，展开后即得结果。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$\\vec a\\times\\vec b=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&0&2\\\\0&1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=\\vec i\\,(0\\cdot(-1)-2\\cdot1)-\\vec j\\,(1\\cdot(-1)-2\\cdot0)+\\vec k\\,(1\\cdot1-0\\cdot0)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>$=(-2)\\vec i-(-1)\\vec j+1\\cdot\\vec k=(-2,1,1)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最容易错的是漏掉 $\\vec j$ 项前的负号，从而把结果写成 $\\vec b\\times\\vec a$（两者恰为相反向量）；其次是混淆向量积与数量积——数量积 $\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=-2$ 是一个数，不是三元数组。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\vec a\\times\\vec b=(-2,1,1)$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"向量代数和空间解析几何","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["平面向量与立体几何"],"knowledgeTags":["数量积、向量积与混合积"],"kpId":"kp-t6-02"},"calc-orig-t6-03":{"id":"calc-orig-t6-03","topic":6,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"过点 $P(1,2,-1)$ 且以 $\\vec n=(2,-1,3)$ 为法向量的平面方程是：","options":["$x+2y-z+3=0$","$2x-y+3z-3=0$","$2x-y+3z+1=0$","$2x-y+3z+3=0$"],"answer":3,"knowledge":"平面方程","hint":"已知法向量和平面上的一个点时，直接用点法式：法向量点乘「动点减已知点」等于零。再把括号展开、合并常数项。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：平面方程的点法式是「法向量 · (动点 − 已知点) = 0」。本题法向量与已知点都已给出，照写点法式再整理成一般式即可，最后代回已知点做一次自检。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>点法式：$2(x-1)-1\\cdot(y-2)+3(z+1)=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>展开合并：$2x-2-y+2+3z+3=0$，即 $2x-y+3z+3=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>代点自检：把 $P(1,2,-1)$ 代入左边得 $2-2-3+3=0$，成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：一是合并常数项时漏项（$-2+2+3$ 中的任意一项算错都会改变常数）；二是把「动点减已知点」写成「动点加已知点」，符号出错。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$2x-y+3z+3=0$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"向量代数和空间解析几何","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["平面向量与立体几何"],"knowledgeTags":["平面方程"],"kpId":"kp-t6-03"},"calc-orig-t6-04":{"id":"calc-orig-t6-04","topic":6,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"已知直线 $L_1$ 过点 $A(1,0,-1)$、方向向量为 $\\vec s_1=(1,2,2)$，直线 $L_2$ 过点 $B(0,1,k)$、方向向量为 $\\vec s_2=(2,1,3)$。若 $L_1$ 与 $L_2$ 相交，则 $k=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"空间直线方程","hint":"两直线相交意味着存在一对参数 $(t,s)$ 让两个参数式给出同一个点。把三个坐标分别列成等式，先解出参数，再代回确定 $k$。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：判定两直线相交，等价于判定「存在同一组参数使两点重合」。把两条直线的参数式写出后，三个坐标各自对应相等，就得到一个含 $t,s$ 和未知常数的方程组，解出参数再回代。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>写出参数式：$L_1:(1+t,\\;2t,\\;-1+2t)$，$L_2:(2s,\\;1+s,\\;k+3s)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>令对应坐标相等：$1+t=2s$，$2t=1+s$，$-1+2t=k+3s$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>由前两式解得 $t=1,\\;s=1$（代回验证：$1+1=2\\times1$ 成立，$2\\times1=1+1$ 成立）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>代入第三式：$-1+2\\times1=k+3\\times1$，即 $1=k+3$，得 $k=-2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：常见错误是把已知点的坐标当成方向向量，或写参数式时用「点减点」算方向却把符号弄反。另外若题目给的是对称式方程且某个分母为零，该情形要单独处理，不能直接约分。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$k=-2$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"向量代数和空间解析几何","estimatedMinutes":4,"prerequisites":["平面向量与立体几何"],"answers":["-2","$-2$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：-2 / $-2$","knowledgeTags":["空间直线方程"],"kpId":"kp-t6-04"},"calc-orig-t6-05":{"id":"calc-orig-t6-05","topic":6,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"点 $P(2,1,-1)$ 到平面 $\\pi:2x-2y+z+3=0$ 的距离是：","options":["$\\frac43$","$\\frac49$","$4$","$\\frac23$"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"距离与夹角","hint":"直接用点到平面的距离公式：分子是把点代入平面方程左端并取绝对值，分母是法向量各分量平方和的算术平方根。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：点到平面的距离只取决于平面的法向量与常数项，把点坐标代入一般式即可，不必先把平面化成其他形式。公式为 $d=\\dfrac{|Ax_0+By_0+Cz_0+D|}{\\sqrt{A^2+B^2+C^2}}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$d=\\dfrac{|2\\times2-2\\times1+(-1)+3|}{\\sqrt{2^{2}+(-2)^{2}+1^{2}}}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>分子 $=|4-2-1+3|=4$，分母 $=\\sqrt{9}=3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>故 $d=\\dfrac43$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两处高频失分：一是分子漏掉绝对值，本题会算出 $-\\dfrac43$；二是分母忘记开方，直接用 $A^2+B^2+C^2=9$ 作分母，得到 $\\dfrac49$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\frac43$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"向量代数和空间解析几何","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["平面向量与立体几何"],"knowledgeTags":["距离与夹角"],"kpId":"kp-t6-05"},"calc-orig-t6-06":{"id":"calc-orig-t6-06","topic":6,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"二次曲面 $2x^{2}-3y^{2}+z^{2}=6$ 是：","options":["椭球面","双叶双曲面","单叶双曲面","椭圆抛物面"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"曲面与空间曲线","hint":"先化成右端为 1 的标准形式，再看左端三个二次项的符号：三正为椭球面，一负为单叶双曲面，两负为双叶双曲面。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：判断二次曲面类型的关键动作是「先标准化、再数符号」：把方程化为右端等于 1 的形式，右端为正时只数左端三个二次项的符号组合。这比凭图像记忆可靠。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>两边同除以 $6$：$\\dfrac{x^{2}}{3}-\\dfrac{y^{2}}{2}+\\dfrac{z^{2}}{6}=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>三个二次项系数依次为 $+\\dfrac13,\\;-\\dfrac12,\\;+\\dfrac16$，即「两正一负」。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>两正一负的二次曲面是单叶双曲面（沿 $y$ 轴方向开口），故选单叶双曲面。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：常见错误是在「单叶 / 双叶」上记反。口诀：<b>一负两正 = 单叶</b>，<b>两负一正 = 双叶</b>。本题只有一个负项，属单叶。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：单叶双曲面。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"向量代数和空间解析几何","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["平面向量与立体几何"],"knowledgeTags":["曲面与空间曲线"],"kpId":"kp-t6-06"},"calc-orig-t7-01":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-01","topic":7,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"设级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}u_n$ 收敛，则下列结论中必然成立的是：","options":["$\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}u_n=0$","$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}u_n$ 绝对收敛","$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}u_n^{2}$ 收敛","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}n u_n=0$"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"常数项级数的概念与性质","hint":"先找由收敛直接推出的必要条件（通项趋于零）；对其它选项各举一个「收敛但不满足该结论」的级数作反例。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：本题考的是「收敛」「绝对收敛」与通项极限之间的充分/必要条件关系。判断「必然成立」时，先锁定由定义直接推出的必要条件，再对其余每个选项各构造一个收敛级数反例。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>级数收敛的必要条件是 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}u_n=0$，故「$\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}u_n=0$」必然成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>但「绝对收敛」不成立：$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n}$ 收敛，取绝对值后却是发散的调和级数，故它条件收敛而非绝对收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>「$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}u_n^{2}$ 收敛」也不成立：取 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{\\sqrt n}$，它收敛，而 $u_n^{2}=\\dfrac1n$，$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1n$ 发散。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>「$\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}n u_n=0$」同样不成立：仍取 $u_n=\\dfrac{(-1)^{n-1}}{\\sqrt n}$，此时 $n u_n=(-1)^{n-1}\\sqrt n$ 不趋于零。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最典型的是把「通项趋于零」当成收敛的<b>充分</b>条件——调和级数 $\\sum 1/n$ 通项趋于零却发散；其次是把「收敛」与「绝对收敛」混同，误选「$\\sum u_n$ 绝对收敛」；而「$\\lim n u_n=0$」是把「通项趋于零」错误加强成「再乘 $n$ 仍趋于零」，并无此依据。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}u_n=0$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["数列极限","无穷小的比较"],"knowledgeTags":["常数项级数的概念与性质"],"kpId":"kp-t7-01"},"calc-orig-t7-02":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-02","topic":7,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"若级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}u_n$ 收敛，则 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(u_n-u_{n+1})=$","options":["$0$","$u_1$","$u_1+u_2$","不存在"],"answer":1,"knowledge":"常数项级数的概念与性质","hint":"先写出部分和，观察相邻项如何两两相消；相消后剩下的尾项再由「收敛级数的通项趋于零」处理。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：这是「望远镜级数」：把通项写成相邻两项之差，部分和就会逐项相消，只剩首尾两项。相消后尾项的极限由原级数收敛这一条件保证为零。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>部分和 $S_N=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(u_n-u_{n+1})=(u_1-u_2)+(u_2-u_3)+\\cdots+(u_N-u_{N+1})=u_1-u_{N+1}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由 $\\displaystyle\\sum u_n$ 收敛知 $\\lim\\limits_{N\\to\\infty}u_{N+1}=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>故 $\\lim\\limits_{N\\to\\infty}S_N=u_1-0=u_1$，即该级数收敛于 $u_1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：常见错误是把部分和写成 $u_1+u_{N+1}$（相消后符号弄反），或忘记说明尾项 $u_{N+1}\\to0$ 就直接给出结论。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$u_1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["数列极限","无穷小的比较"],"knowledgeTags":["常数项级数的概念与性质"],"kpId":"kp-t7-01"},"calc-orig-t7-03":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-03","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"下列级数中发散的是：","options":["$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n^{2}}$","$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n^{3/2}}$","$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{2^{n}}$","$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}$"],"answer":3,"knowledge":"正项级数的判别法","hint":"先逐个辨认类型：三个 $p$ 级数关键看 $p$ 与 1 的大小，另一个是公比小于 1 的几何级数。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：四个选项里三个是标准的 $p$ 级数、一个是几何级数，判断依据就是这两类级数的敛散结论。做题时先辨类型，再看参数落在收敛段还是发散段。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$p$ 级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum\\frac{1}{n^{p}}$ 当 $p>1$ 收敛、当 $p\\le1$ 发散。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>$\\displaystyle\\sum\\frac{1}{n^{2}}$（$p=2>1$）收敛；$\\displaystyle\\sum\\frac{1}{n^{3/2}}$（$p=\\frac32>1$）收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>$\\displaystyle\\sum\\frac1n$ 是 $p=1$ 的临界情形，发散；$\\displaystyle\\sum\\frac{1}{2^{n}}$ 是公比 $\\frac12<1$ 的几何级数，收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：关键一步是认出 $\\dfrac1n=n^{-1}$ 正是 $p=1$ 的<b>临界情形</b>，它在发散一侧。把 $p$ 级数结论记成「$p\\ge1$ 收敛」是最常见的错误。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["数列极限","无穷小的比较"],"knowledgeTags":["正项级数的判别法"],"kpId":"kp-t7-02"},"calc-orig-t7-04":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-04","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n\\sqrt{n}}$ 的敛散性是____（填\"收敛\"或\"发散\"）。","knowledge":"正项级数的判别法","hint":"先把根式写成幂的形式，看它化为哪一个标准的 $p$ 级数；再判断 $p$ 与 1 的大小。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：通项里带根式时，第一步统一写成 $n$ 的幂，把它还原成 $p$ 级数的标准形式，之后再套用 $p$ 级数判别法。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$\\dfrac{1}{n\\sqrt n}=\\dfrac{1}{n\\cdot n^{1/2}}=n^{-3/2}$，这是 $p=\\dfrac32$ 的 $p$ 级数。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>因 $p=\\dfrac32>1$，由 $p$ 级数判别法知原级数收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：常见错误是把 $n\\sqrt n$ 误看成 $n$ 的一次幂（漏掉 $\\sqrt n$ 这一层），从而错判为 $p=1$ 的调和级数而答「发散」。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：收敛。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["数列极限","无穷小的比较"],"answers":["收敛","converge","convergent"],"answerNote":"填「收敛」或 converge / convergent（大小写、空格不敏感）","knowledgeTags":["正项级数的判别法"],"kpId":"kp-t7-02"},"calc-orig-t7-05":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-05","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n}$ 是：","options":["条件收敛","绝对收敛","发散","无法判断"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"交错级数与条件收敛","hint":"两步走：先看绝对值级数是否收敛（判断绝对收敛）；若不绝对收敛，再回到交错级数本身，用莱布尼茨判别法的两个条件判断它是否收敛。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：判断含 $(-1)^n$ 的级数，标准流程是「两步走」：先对绝对值级数下判断（是否绝对收敛），再单独判断交错级数本身（是否条件收敛）。两步合起来才能给出完整结论。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>取绝对值得 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1n$，即 $p=1$ 的 $p$ 级数，发散，故原级数不绝对收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>原级数是交错级数，$u_n=\\dfrac1n$ 单调递减且 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}u_n=0$，由莱布尼茨判别法知它收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>收敛但不绝对收敛，故为条件收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最典型的错误是看到莱布尼茨判别法成立就答「绝对收敛」，把「收敛」与「绝对收敛」当成同一件事；另一处是漏验莱布尼茨条件中「单调递减」与「趋于零」的任一条。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：条件收敛。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["数列极限","无穷小的比较"],"knowledgeTags":["交错级数与条件收敛"],"kpId":"kp-t7-03"},"calc-orig-t7-06":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-06","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{\\sqrt{n}}$ 是____（填\"绝对收敛\"或\"条件收敛\"）。","knowledge":"交错级数与条件收敛","hint":"先看绝对值级数是不是熟悉的 $p$ 级数、$p$ 等于多少；再用莱布尼茨判别法确认原级数本身收敛。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：与上一题同一套路，差别只在绝对值级数：这里 $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt n}=n^{-1/2}$ 是 $p=\\dfrac12$ 的 $p$ 级数。先判绝对收敛的成败，再判交错级数本身。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>绝对值级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt n}$ 是 $p=\\dfrac12$ 的 $p$ 级数，因 $p<1$ 而发散，故不绝对收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>原级数交错，$u_n=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt n}$ 单调递减且趋于 0，由莱布尼茨判别法知它收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>收敛但不绝对收敛，故为条件收敛。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：容易把 $\\sqrt n$ 的幂次记错——$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt n}=n^{-1/2}$ 对应 $p=\\dfrac12<1$，绝对值级数发散，因此应答「条件收敛」而不是「绝对收敛」。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：条件收敛。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["数列极限","无穷小的比较"],"answers":["条件收敛","conditionally convergent"],"answerNote":"填「条件收敛」或 conditionally convergent（大小写、空格不敏感）","knowledgeTags":["交错级数与条件收敛"],"kpId":"kp-t7-03"},"calc-orig-t7-07":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-07","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"幂级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n}}{n\\cdot 3^{n}}$ 的收敛半径是：","options":["$1$","$\\frac13$","$3$","$9$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"幂级数与收敛半径","hint":"系数 $a_n=\\dfrac{1}{n\\cdot3^{n}}$，用收敛半径的相邻系数比值公式求极限；注意 $3^{n+1}/3^{n}$ 这个因子。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：幂级数收敛半径有相邻系数比、通项比、根值三种等价算法。本题系数里带 $3^n$，用「相邻系数比值」最直接：把 $a_{n+1}/a_n$ 写成显式再取极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$a_n=\\dfrac{1}{n\\cdot3^{n}}$，$a_{n+1}=\\dfrac{1}{(n+1)\\cdot3^{n+1}}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>$R=\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\frac{a_n}{a_{n+1}}\\right|=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{(n+1)\\cdot3^{n+1}}{n\\cdot3^{n}}=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3(n+1)}{n}=3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：一是漏掉 $3^{n+1}/3^{n}=3$ 这个因子，从而得到 $R=1$；二是把「收敛半径」与「收敛区间」「收敛域」当成同义词——本题只问半径，不必讨论端点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$R=3$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["比值判别法"],"knowledgeTags":["幂级数与收敛半径"],"kpId":"kp-t7-04"},"calc-orig-t7-08":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-08","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"幂级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n}}{2^{n}}$ 的收敛域是____（填区间，例如 $(-1,1)$ 或 $[-1,1)$）。","knowledge":"幂级数与收敛半径","hint":"先由系数求出收敛半径，得到开区间；再把两个端点 $x=\\pm R$ 分别代回级数，单独判断敛散。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：「收敛区间」由收敛半径直接给出，而「收敛域」还必须加上端点的敛散结论。因此求收敛域的固定动作是：先由 $R$ 写出开区间，再逐个端点代回原级数判断。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$a_n=\\dfrac{1}{2^{n}}$，$R=\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\frac{a_n}{a_{n+1}}\\right|=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{2^{n+1}}{2^{n}}=2$，故收敛区间为 $(-2,2)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>端点 $x=2$：通项为 $\\dfrac{2^{n}}{2^{n}}=1$，不趋于零，级数发散。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>端点 $x=-2$：通项为 $\\dfrac{(-2)^{n}}{2^{n}}=(-1)^{n}$，同样不趋于零，发散。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>两端点均发散，故收敛域为 $(-2,2)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最常见的错误是求出 $R=2$ 后直接写收敛域为 $[-2,2]$，跳过了端点讨论。本题两个端点的通项都不趋于零，都应收敛域之外。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：收敛域为 $(-2,2)$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["比值判别法"],"answers":["(-2,2)","（-2,2）","-2<x<2"],"answerNote":"等价写法：(-2,2) / （-2,2） / -2<x<2","knowledgeTags":["幂级数与收敛半径"],"kpId":"kp-t7-04"},"calc-orig-t7-09":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-09","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"幂级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n}}{n!}$ 的和函数是：","options":["$\\mathrm{e}^{-x}$","$\\mathrm{e}^{x}$","$\\ln(1+x)$","$\\dfrac{1}{1-x}$"],"answer":1,"knowledge":"函数展开成幂级数","hint":"回想五个标准麦克劳林展开式中，哪一个的系数正好是 $\\dfrac{1}{n!}$。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：这是标准麦克劳林展开式的识别题，系数的形状就是唯一线索：见到 $\\dfrac{1}{n!}$ 应立刻联想到 $\\mathrm{e}^{x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$\\mathrm{e}^{x}=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n}}{n!}$ 对一切 $x\\in\\mathbb{R}$ 成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>故所求和函数为 $\\mathrm{e}^{x}$，收敛域为 $(-\\infty,+\\infty)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：容易与 $\\dfrac{1}{1-x}=\\sum x^{n}$（系数恒为 1）或 $\\ln(1+x)=\\sum\\dfrac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n}x^{n}$（系数含 $\\dfrac1n$ 而不含阶乘）混淆。分母只有阶乘、没有 $n$ 的幂，才是 $\\mathrm{e}^{x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\mathrm{e}^{x}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["基本求导公式"],"knowledgeTags":["函数展开成幂级数"],"kpId":"kp-t7-05"},"calc-orig-t7-10":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-10","topic":7,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"求幂级数 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n}}{n}$ 的收敛域与和函数。","knowledge":"函数展开成幂级数","hint":"第一步定收敛半径、逐个讨论端点；第二步求和函数——先逐项求导把系数化掉，再用 $S(0)=0$ 定出积分常数，最后回代端点检验和函数的有效范围。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：幂级数求和的固定套路是「先逐项求导（或积分）把系数变简单，再对结果做逆运算」。这里系数是 $\\dfrac1n$，求导后会消失，正适合逐项求导。求得原函数后必须用 $x=0$ 处的值定下积分常数，最后回代端点检验和函数的有效范围。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$a_n=\\dfrac1n$，$R=\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left|\\frac{a_n}{a_{n+1}}\\right|=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{n+1}{n}=1$，收敛区间为 $(-1,1)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>端点 $x=1$：$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1n$ 为调和级数，发散；端点 $x=-1$：$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{n}$ 为交错调和级数，由莱布尼茨判别法收敛。故收敛域为 $[-1,1)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>求和函数：当 $|x|<1$ 时设 $S(x)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n}}{n}$，逐项求导得 $S'(x)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}x^{n-1}=\\frac{1}{1-x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>两端积分并用 $S(0)=0$ 定常数：$S(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{x}\\frac{dt}{1-t}=-\\ln(1-x)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>端点核对：$x=-1$ 时 $-\\ln\\bigl(1-(-1)\\bigr)=-\\ln2$，与交错调和级数的和一致，说明和函数在 $x=-1$ 处仍成立；$x=1$ 处级数发散，$x=1$ 不在和函数定义域内。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：三处高频失分：① 只写收敛区间 $(-1,1)$ 而不讨论端点，漏掉 $x=-1$ 处收敛；② 逐项积分后不修正常数项（由 $S(0)=0$ 应得 $C=0$）；③ 把收敛域误写成 $[-1,1]$，忽略了 $x=1$ 处发散。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：收敛域为 $[-1,1)$，和函数为 $S(x)=-\\ln(1-x)$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":10,"prerequisites":["比值判别法"],"answerText":"收敛域 $[-1,1)$；和函数 $S(x)=-\\ln(1-x)$（$-1\\le x<1$）。","knowledgeTags":["函数展开成幂级数"],"kpId":"kp-t7-05"},"calc-orig-t7-11":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-11","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"设 $f(x)$ 是以 $2\\pi$ 为周期的函数，且在 $[-\\pi,\\pi)$ 上 $f(x)=x$。记其傅里叶级数的和函数为 $S(x)$，则 $S(\\pi)=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"傅里叶级数","hint":"先判断 $x=\\pi$ 是延拓后函数的什么点；若为间断点，则按狄利克雷收敛定理取左右极限的算术平均，而不是直接代函数值。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：本题不需要求出任何傅里叶系数，只需认定 $x=\\pi$ 是间断点，再套用狄利克雷收敛定理：连续点取函数值，间断点取左右极限的平均值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>由 $f$ 的周期性与 $f(x)=x$（$x\\in[-\\pi,\\pi)$）知，$x=\\pi$ 是间断点，左极限 $f(\\pi-0)=\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>右极限需用周期性把 $\\pi^{+}$ 平移回 $-\\pi^{+}$：$f(\\pi+0)=f(-\\pi+0)=-\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>由狄利克雷收敛定理，间断点处 $S(\\pi)=\\dfrac{f(\\pi-0)+f(\\pi+0)}{2}=\\dfrac{\\pi+(-\\pi)}{2}=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最典型的错误是直接把 $x=\\pi$ 代入 $f(x)=x$ 得 $S(\\pi)=\\pi$，忽略了这里是不连续点；另一处是求右极限时忘记用周期性把 $\\pi^{+}$ 平移回 $-\\pi^{+}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$S(\\pi)=0$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":4,"prerequisites":["数列极限","无穷小的比较"],"answers":["0","$0$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：0 / $0$","knowledgeTags":["傅里叶级数"],"kpId":"kp-t7-06"},"calc-orig-t7-12":{"id":"calc-orig-t7-12","topic":7,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"设 $f(x)=x$，$x\\in[-\\pi,\\pi)$。记其傅里叶级数为 $\\dfrac{a_0}{2}+\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\left(a_n\\cos nx+b_n\\sin nx\\right)$，则 $b_1=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"傅里叶级数","hint":"先判断 $f$ 的奇偶性以确定哪些系数为零；求 $b_1$ 时利用奇偶性把积分缩到 $[0,\\pi]$，再用分部积分算出结果。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：求傅里叶系数前先判奇偶性，能立刻消掉一半系数；剩下的积分用奇偶性把区间缩半，再用分部积分。正弦系数的标准公式是 $b_n=\\dfrac1\\pi\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}f(x)\\sin nx\\,dx$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$f(x)=x$ 是奇函数，故 $a_0=0$、$a_n=0\\ (n\\ge1)$，只需计算正弦系数。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>$b_1=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}x\\sin x\\,dx=\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^{\\pi}x\\sin x\\,dx$（被积函数 $x\\sin x$ 为偶函数）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi}x\\sin x\\,dx=\\Bigl[-x\\cos x+\\sin x\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi}=-\\pi\\cos\\pi+\\sin\\pi-0=\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>故 $b_1=\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot\\pi=2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：三处常见错误：① 没注意 $x\\sin x$ 是偶函数而直接在一般区间积分，符号容易出错；② 分部积分结果 $-x\\cos x+\\sin x$ 的符号写反；③ 整体因子 $\\dfrac1\\pi$ 漏乘，或把它误写成 $\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$——$\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$ 只是「用偶函数把区间缩半」那一步的系数，整体仍是 $\\dfrac1\\pi$ 配一个 2。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$b_1=2$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目阶段四原创题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"无穷级数","estimatedMinutes":4,"prerequisites":["定积分分部积分法"],"answers":["2","$2$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：2 / $2$","knowledgeTags":["傅里叶级数"],"kpId":"kp-t7-06"},"calc-orig-t0-11":{"id":"calc-orig-t0-11","topic":0,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"函数 $f(x)=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2-x}}{\\ln(x+1)}$ 的定义域是（　）。","options":["$(-1,2]$","$[-1,0)\\cup(0,2]$","$(-1,0)\\cup(0,2]$","$(-1,2)$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"函数的概念与基本初等函数","hint":"定义域要同时满足三条限制：偶次根号内非负、对数真数为正、分母不为零。逐条写出不等式（组）后取交集，再单独检查端点能否取到。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：定义域就是「各条限制条件的交集」：偶次根号内 $\\ge0$、对数真数 $>0$、分母 $\\ne0$。逐条写出不等式后取交集，最后单独检查端点是否可取。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>偶次根式要求 $2-x\\ge0$，得 $x\\le2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>对数要求真数为正：$x+1>0$，得 $x>-1$；又因 $\\ln(x+1)$ 出现在分母，需 $\\ln(x+1)\\ne0$，即 $x+1\\ne1$，得 $x\\ne0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>取三条限制的交集，得 $x\\in(-1,0)\\cup(0,2]$，即选项 C。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两类高频错误：① 只由 $2-x\\ge0$ 与 $x+1>0$ 得到 $(-1,2]$，<b>漏掉分母不为零</b>，把 $x=0$ 也收进了定义域；② 把对数真数的条件写成 $x+1\\ge0$（应为严格大于），误把 $x=-1$ 收进来。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$(-1,0)\\cup(0,2]$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["函数定义域","基本初等函数的定义域"],"knowledgeTags":["函数的概念与基本初等函数"],"kpId":"kp-t0-11"},"calc-orig-t0-12":{"id":"calc-orig-t0-12","topic":0,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n^2+1}}+\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n^2+2}}+\\cdots+\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n^2+n}}\\right)=$（　）。","options":["$0$","$\\dfrac12$","$1$","$+\\infty$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"极限的存在准则","hint":"和式的项数随 $n$ 变化，不能逐项求极限。注意每一项的分母都落在同一个范围内，据此把整个和式夹在上下两个「同结构」的表达式之间，再让两端同时取极限。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：项数随 $n$ 变化的和式不能逐项取极限。识别「每一项介于同一族两个表达式之间」这一结构，用分母的最大值与最小值把整体夹住，再对上下两端同时求极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>和式共 $n$ 项，第 $k$ 项的分母为 $\\sqrt{n^2+k}$（$1\\le k\\le n$）。分母越大分数越小，故 $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n^2+n}}\\le\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n^2+k}}\\le\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n^2+1}}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>对该不等式按 $k=1,2,\\dots,n$ 求和（共 $n$ 项），得 $\\dfrac{n}{\\sqrt{n^2+n}}\\le S_n\\le\\dfrac{n}{\\sqrt{n^2+1}}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>两端都趋于 1：$\\dfrac{n}{\\sqrt{n^2+n}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac1n}}\\to1$，$\\dfrac{n}{\\sqrt{n^2+1}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{n^2}}}\\to1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>由夹逼准则，中间的和式也趋于 1，故选 C。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：三类典型错误：① 把 $n$ 项之和当成有限项逐项取极限；② 只写出上界或只写出下界就下结论——夹逼准则要求<b>两侧极限都存在且相等</b>；③ 两端算得不同的值后取平均或凭直觉挑一个。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["数列极限","极限的四则运算"],"knowledgeTags":["极限的存在准则"],"kpId":"kp-t0-12"},"calc-orig-t0-13":{"id":"calc-orig-t0-13","topic":0,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"设 $a$ 为常数。若 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{x+a}{x-a}\\right)^{x}=e^{4}$，则 $a=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"第二重要极限","hint":"底数趋于 1、指数趋于无穷，是 $1^{\\infty}$ 型。先把底数写成 $1+$（无穷小）的形式，再用 $1^{\\infty}$ 型的推广结论把幂指型极限化为普通极限。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：识别 $1^{\\infty}$ 型：底数趋于 1、指数趋于无穷。先做恒等变形把底数写成 $1+\\square$，再用推广式 $e^{\\lim\\square\\cdot\\text{指数}}$，把幂指型极限化为普通极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>把底数改写成 $1+\\square$ 的形式：$\\dfrac{x+a}{x-a}=1+\\dfrac{2a}{x-a}$，其中 $\\dfrac{2a}{x-a}\\to0$（$x\\to\\infty$）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>这是 $1^{\\infty}$ 型，按第二重要极限的推广：原式 $=e^{\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac{2a}{x-a}\\right)\\cdot x}=e^{\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{2ax}{x-a}}=e^{2a}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>由 $e^{2a}=e^{4}$ 得 $2a=4$，故 $a=2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：三处常见错误：① 没有把底数先化成 $1+\\square$，直接对幂指式套用公式而出错；② 指数与底数不配对，误算成 $e^{a^2}$ 之类；③ 由 $e^{2a}=e^{4}$ 解 $a$ 时忘记除以 2，误得 $a=4$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$a=2$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["第一重要极限","指数与对数运算"],"answers":["2","$2$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：2 / $2$（只填 $a$ 的数值）","knowledgeTags":["第二重要极限"],"kpId":"kp-t0-13"},"calc-orig-t0-14":{"id":"calc-orig-t0-14","topic":0,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"当 $x\\to0$ 时，$\\tan x-\\sin x$ 是 $x$ 的（　）阶无穷小。","options":["$1$ 阶","$2$ 阶","$3$ 阶","$4$ 阶"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"无穷小的比较","hint":"判断阶数就是找使 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\tan x-\\sin x}{x^{k}}$ 为非零常数的 $k$。先把 $\\tan x-\\sin x$ 提公因式化成「简单无穷小 × 简单无穷小」的乘积，再分别确定各因子的阶。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：判断阶数的通用做法：把待比较的量分解成若干无穷小的乘积，各因子的阶相加即为总阶；遇到加减时必须先提公因式化成乘积，不能对每一项分别做等价替换。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>提公因式：$\\tan x-\\sin x=\\sin x\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\cos x}-1\\right)=\\sin x\\cdot\\dfrac{1-\\cos x}{\\cos x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>分别定阶：$\\sin x\\sim x$（1 阶），$1-\\cos x\\sim\\dfrac{x^{2}}{2}$（2 阶），而 $\\dfrac{1}{\\cos x}\\to1$ 是非零常数因子，不影响阶数。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>阶数相加得 $1+2=3$，即 $\\tan x-\\sin x\\sim\\dfrac{x^{3}}{2}$，它是 $x$ 的 3 阶无穷小，故选 C。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最典型的错误是把 $\\tan x\\sim x$、$\\sin x\\sim x$ 直接相减得 0，从而定不出阶——<b>等价无穷小在加减运算中不能随意替换</b>，必须先化成乘积。另一处错误是把 $\\frac{1}{\\cos x}\\to1$ 误当成额外的阶。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：3 阶。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["等价无穷小","同阶无穷小的定义"],"knowledgeTags":["无穷小的比较"],"kpId":"kp-t0-14"},"calc-orig-t0-15":{"id":"calc-orig-t0-15","topic":0,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"设函数 $f(x)$ 在闭区间 $[0,1]$ 上连续，且对任意 $x\\in[0,1]$ 都有 $0\\le f(x)\\le1$。证明：存在 $\\xi\\in[0,1]$，使得 $f(\\xi)=\\xi$。","knowledge":"闭区间上连续函数的性质","hint":"把「求不动点」转化为「求零点」：构造 $g(x)=f(x)-x$，先说明它在闭区间上连续，再观察两个端点的函数值符号，最后用零点定理。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：证明「存在 $\\xi$ 使 $f(\\xi)=\\xi$」的固定套路：移项构造辅助函数 $g(x)=f(x)-x$，把「求不动点」转化为「求零点」；随后先验证连续性与端点符号，再套零点定理，最后补上端点恰好取零的平凡情形。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>构造辅助函数 $g(x)=f(x)-x$。因 $f(x)$ 与 $x$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上都连续，故 $g(x)$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续——这是使用零点定理的前提。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由条件 $0\\le f(x)\\le1$ 得端点值：$g(0)=f(0)-0=f(0)\\ge0$，$g(1)=f(1)-1\\le0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>分类讨论：若 $g(0)=0$，取 $\\xi=0$ 即得 $f(\\xi)=\\xi$；若 $g(1)=0$，取 $\\xi=1$ 即得；若 $g(0)>0$ 且 $g(1)<0$，则由零点定理，存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$ 使 $g(\\xi)=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>综上，无论哪种情形都存在 $\\xi\\in[0,1]$ 使 $g(\\xi)=0$，即 $f(\\xi)=\\xi$，证毕。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两处高频失分：① 使用零点定理前<b>没有说明 $g$ 在闭区间上连续</b>——「闭区间连续」与「端点异号」是零点定理的两个前提，缺一不可；② 只讨论 $g(0)>0$、$g(1)<0$ 的情形，漏掉 $f(0)=0$ 或 $f(1)=1$ 时 $\\xi$ 应取端点的平凡情况。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：存在 $\\xi\\in[0,1]$，使 $f(\\xi)=\\xi$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"函数、极限、连续","estimatedMinutes":10,"prerequisites":["函数连续性","零点定理"],"answerText":"构造 $g(x)=f(x)-x$。因 $f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续，$g$ 也在 $[0,1]$ 上连续。由 $0\\le f(x)\\le1$ 得 $g(0)=f(0)\\ge0$，$g(1)=f(1)-1\\le0$。若 $g(0)=0$，取 $\\xi=0$；若 $g(1)=0$，取 $\\xi=1$；否则 $g(0)>0$ 且 $g(1)<0$，由零点定理存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$ 使 $g(\\xi)=0$。综上，存在 $\\xi\\in[0,1]$ 使 $f(\\xi)=\\xi$。","knowledgeTags":["闭区间上连续函数的性质"],"kpId":"kp-t0-15"},"calc-orig-t1-10":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-10","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"设 $f(x)=\\begin{cases} x^{2}\\sin\\dfrac1x, & x\\ne0 \\\\ 0, & x=0 \\end{cases}$，则 $f'(0)=$（　）。","options":["$0$","$1$","不存在","$2x\\sin\\dfrac1x-\\cos\\dfrac1x$"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"导数的定义与可导性","hint":"分段点处的导数要用定义算：写出差商 $\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}{x-0}$，再看它当 $x\\to0$ 时的极限。不要直接套用 $x\\ne0$ 时的求导公式再代入。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：分段函数在分段点处的导数一律回到定义：算差商的极限。本题的关键观察是分子能约掉一个 $x$，剩下「无穷小 × 有界量」的结构。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>因 $f(0)=0$，按定义 $f'(0)=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{f(x)-f(0)}{x-0}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x^{2}\\sin\\frac1x}{x}=\\lim_{x\\to0}x\\sin\\dfrac1x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>其中 $\\sin\\frac1x$ 在 $0$ 附近有界，而 $x\\to0$ 是无穷小；无穷小与有界量的乘积仍为无穷小。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>故 $f'(0)=0$，对应选项「$0$」。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：三类典型错误：① 直接用 $x\\ne0$ 时的求导公式 $f'(x)=2x\\sin\\frac1x-\\cos\\frac1x$ 再令 $x=0$，得到一个无意义的表达式——<b>分段点处必须用定义</b>；② 因 $\\sin\\frac1x$ 在 $0$ 附近振荡而误判「极限不存在」，忽略了它前面还乘着 $x$；③ 把 $f'(0)$ 与 $\\lim_{x\\to0}f'(x)$ 混为一谈（后者确实不存在，但这并不影响 $f'(0)=0$）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$0$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["导数的定义","极限的计算"],"knowledgeTags":["导数的定义与可导性"],"kpId":"kp-t1-10"},"calc-orig-t1-11":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-11","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"下列函数中，在 $x=0$ 处连续但不可导的是（　）。","options":["$f(x)=x^{2}$","$f(x)=\\begin{cases} x^{2}\\sin\\dfrac1x, & x\\ne0 \\\\ 0, & x=0 \\end{cases}$","$f(x)=\\lvert x\\rvert$","$f(x)=\\lvert x^{3}\\rvert$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"可导与连续的关系","hint":"逐个核对两件事：先看 $x\\to0$ 时函数值是否趋于 $f(0)$（连续），再按定义算 $\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(h)-f(0)}{h}$（可导）。注意 $\\lvert x\\rvert$ 与 $\\lvert x^{3}\\rvert$ 的差别在于后者在 $0$ 处「变得平坦」。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：判断「连续但不可导」要分别过两道关：连续看 $\\lim f(x)$ 是否等于 $f(0)$；可导按定义算差商 $\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}{x-0}$ 的极限。常见不可导形态有两类：左右差商不等（尖点，如 $\\lvert x\\rvert$）与差商无极限（振荡，如 $x\\sin\\frac1x$）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$y=x^{2}$ 是多项式，处处可导，不符合。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>$f(x)=x^{2}\\sin\\frac1x$（补 $f(0)=0$）：先看连续，$x^{2}\\sin\\frac1x\\to0=f(0)$ 成立；再用定义求导，$\\dfrac{f(x)-f(0)}{x}=x\\sin\\frac1x\\to0$（无穷小乘有界量），故 $f'(0)=0$，可导，不符合。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>$f(x)=\\lvert x\\rvert$：连续，但 $\\dfrac{\\lvert x\\rvert}{x}$ 在 $x\\to0^{+}$ 时趋于 $1$、在 $x\\to0^{-}$ 时趋于 $-1$，左右极限不等，故 $f'(0)$ 不存在——符合题意。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>$f(x)=\\lvert x^{3}\\rvert=\\lvert x\\rvert^{3}$：由定义 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\lvert x\\rvert^{3}}{x}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\lvert x\\rvert^{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\lvert x\\rvert}{x}=0$，可导，不符合。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：高频错误是<b>把「连续」当成「可导」</b>，看到函数连续就默认可导，从而漏掉 $\\lvert x\\rvert$；反向的错误是把尖点当作不可导的唯一形态，忽略差商无极限（振荡）同样可能导致不可导。判断可导务必回到定义算差商的极限，不能只看函数图象是否「光滑」。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$f(x)=\\lvert x\\rvert$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["导数的定义","函数连续性"],"knowledgeTags":["可导与连续的关系"],"kpId":"kp-t1-11"},"calc-orig-t1-12":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-12","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"设由参数方程 $\\begin{cases} x=t-\\sin t \\\\ y=1-\\cos t \\end{cases}$ 确定的函数为 $y=y(x)$，则 $\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}\\Big|_{t=\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"隐函数与参数方程求导","hint":"参数方程求导先算 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}$。求二阶导时，要把 $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ 看成 $t$ 的函数再对 $t$ 求导，最后除以 $\\frac{dx}{dt}$，而不是把两个二阶导数相除。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：参数方程求导分两步：一阶用 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}$；二阶把一阶结果记作 $t$ 的函数 $g(t)$，再用 $\\frac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}=\\frac{g'(t)}{x'(t)}$。只要求二阶导，就必须再除以一次 $\\frac{dx}{dt}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$\\dfrac{dx}{dt}=1-\\cos t$，$\\dfrac{dy}{dt}=\\sin t$，故 $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{\\sin t}{1-\\cos t}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>求二阶导：$\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{dx/dt}\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\left(\\dfrac{\\sin t}{1-\\cos t}\\right)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>计算 $\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\left(\\dfrac{\\sin t}{1-\\cos t}\\right)=\\dfrac{\\cos t(1-\\cos t)-\\sin t\\cdot\\sin t}{(1-\\cos t)^{2}}=\\dfrac{\\cos t-1}{(1-\\cos t)^{2}}=-\\dfrac{1}{1-\\cos t}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>故 $\\dfrac{d^{2}y}{dx^{2}}=-\\dfrac{1}{(1-\\cos t)^{2}}$；代入 $t=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$（此时 $\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$）得 $-1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最典型的错误是把参数方程的二阶导写成 $\\frac{d^{2}y/dt^{2}}{d^{2}x/dt^{2}}$——这是<b>错误的</b>：$y$ 关于 $x$ 的二阶导是「对 $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ 再求一次关于 $x$ 的导数」，必须除以 $\\frac{dx}{dt}$。另一处是化简 $\\frac{\\cos t-1}{(1-\\cos t)^{2}}$ 时把符号写反。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$-1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["参数方程求导","复合函数求导"],"answers":["-1","$-1$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：-1 / $-1$","knowledgeTags":["隐函数与参数方程求导"],"kpId":"kp-t1-12"},"calc-orig-t1-13":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-13","topic":1,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"设函数 $f(x)$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续，在 $(0,1)$ 内可导，且 $f(0)=f(1)=0$。证明：存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$，使得 $f'(\\xi)=f(\\xi)$。","knowledge":"微分中值定理","hint":"把结论移项成 $f'(\\xi)-f(\\xi)=0$，它提示我们要找一个函数，使其导数正好含有因子 $f'(x)-f(x)$；再对该函数在 $[0,1]$ 上用罗尔定理。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：见到「存在 $\\xi$ 使 $f'(\\xi)=g(\\xi)$」这类结论，套路是移项成 $f'-g=0$，再构造辅助函数使其导数正好含因子 $f'-g$，然后对辅助函数用罗尔定理。当 $g=kf$（$k$ 为常数）时，辅助函数取 $F(x)=e^{-kx}f(x)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>结论 $f'(\\xi)=f(\\xi)$ 等价于 $f'(\\xi)-f(\\xi)=0$，即某个函数在 $\\xi$ 处导数为零——这提示构造辅助函数并用罗尔定理。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>注意 $(e^{-x}f(x))'=e^{-x}f'(x)-e^{-x}f(x)=e^{-x}\\left(f'(x)-f(x)\\right)$，其中恰好出现 $f'(x)-f(x)$，故取辅助函数 $F(x)=e^{-x}f(x)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>验证罗尔定理的条件：$f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续、在 $(0,1)$ 内可导，$e^{-x}$ 处处可导，故 $F$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续、在 $(0,1)$ 内可导；又 $F(0)=e^{0}f(0)=0$、$F(1)=e^{-1}f(1)=0$，两端点函数值相等。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>由罗尔定理，存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$ 使 $F'(\\xi)=0$，即 $e^{-\\xi}\\left(f'(\\xi)-f(\\xi)\\right)=0$。因 $e^{-\\xi}>0$，得 $f'(\\xi)=f(\\xi)$。证毕。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两处易失分：① <b>辅助函数构造错</b>——误取 $F(x)=f(x)e^{-x}$ 的零点为答案（它的零点是 $f$ 的零点，不是 $f'-f$ 的零点），或干脆硬套 $F=f$，导致罗尔定理给出的结论对不上题目；② 用罗尔定理前<b>没有逐条验证三个条件</b>，尤其漏掉「$F$ 在 $(0,1)$ 内可导」的说明。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$，使 $f'(\\xi)=f(\\xi)$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["罗尔定理","函数连续性"],"answerText":"取 $F(x)=e^{-x}f(x)$。因 $f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续、在 $(0,1)$ 内可导，$e^{-x}$ 处处可导，故 $F$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续、在 $(0,1)$ 内可导；且 $F(0)=F(1)=0$。由罗尔定理，存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$ 使 $F'(\\xi)=0$。而 $F'(x)=e^{-x}\\left(f'(x)-f(x)\\right)$，且 $e^{-\\xi}>0$，故 $f'(\\xi)-f(\\xi)=0$，即 $f'(\\xi)=f(\\xi)$。证毕。","knowledgeTags":["微分中值定理"],"kpId":"kp-t1-13"},"calc-orig-t1-14":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-14","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"极限 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{x+\\sin x}{x-\\cos x}$ 的值为（　）。","options":["$0$","$1$","$2$","不存在"],"answer":1,"knowledge":"洛必达法则","hint":"先判断这是不是未定式、能不能用洛必达。分子分母都趋于无穷，但直接分别求导会得到一个振荡的式子；换个思路——把分子分母同除以 $x$。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：遇到含 $\\sin x$、$\\cos x$ 的 $\\frac{\\infty}{\\infty}$ 型，先用「分子分母同除以最高次幂」把振荡项压成无穷小。不要一上来就用洛必达，更不要在求导后极限不存在时硬下结论。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>当 $x\\to+\\infty$ 时分子、分母都趋于 $+\\infty$，形式上属 $\\frac{\\infty}{\\infty}$ 型。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>若贸然用洛必达法则，得到 $\\dfrac{1+\\cos x}{1+\\sin x}$，它随 $x$ 振荡、极限不存在——说明洛必达法则在此处<b>得不出结论</b>（法则只在「导数之比的极限存在」时才保证可用）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>改用除法：分子分母同除以 $x$，得 $\\dfrac{1+\\frac{\\sin x}{x}}{1-\\frac{\\cos x}{x}}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>因 $\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\to0$、$\\frac{\\cos x}{x}\\to0$（无穷小乘有界量），故原极限为 $\\dfrac{1+0}{1-0}=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最常见的是<b>不验条件就套洛必达</b>，或套了却不检查「导数之比的极限是否存在」。本题正是反例：形式上确为 $\\frac{\\infty}{\\infty}$，但求导后 $\\frac{1+\\cos x}{1+\\sin x}$ 的极限不存在，此时洛必达法则给不出任何结论，必须改用其他方法。另一处错误是看到振荡项就直接断言「极限不存在」，忽略了 $x$ 在分母上的压制作用。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["洛必达法则的适用条件","极限的四则运算"],"knowledgeTags":["洛必达法则"],"kpId":"kp-t1-14"},"calc-orig-t1-15":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-15","topic":1,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"用泰勒公式求极限 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\cos 2x-e^{-2x^{2}}}{x^{4}}$。","knowledge":"泰勒公式","hint":"分母是 $x^{4}$，所以分子中两个函数都要展开到 $x^{4}$ 项（含），各带 $o(x^{4})$ 余项；先看低阶项能否相消，剩下的最低阶项决定极限。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：用泰勒求 $\\frac00$ 型极限的规则是「分母的阶决定展开到哪一阶」：分母为 $x^{n}$，分子各函数就展开到 $x^{n}$ 并带 $o(x^{n})$，再相减、约分，剩下的最低阶项决定极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>判断阶数：分母为 $x^{4}$，故分子必须展开到 $x^{4}$；若只展开到 $x^{2}$，低阶项相消后就无法判断极限。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>$\\cos 2x=1-\\dfrac{(2x)^{2}}{2}+\\dfrac{(2x)^{4}}{24}+o(x^{4})=1-2x^{2}+\\dfrac{2}{3}x^{4}+o(x^{4})$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>$e^{-2x^{2}}=1+(-2x^{2})+\\dfrac{(-2x^{2})^{2}}{2}+o(x^{4})=1-2x^{2}+2x^{4}+o(x^{4})$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>相减：常数项与 $x^{2}$ 项恰好抵消，剩下 $\\left(\\dfrac{2}{3}-2\\right)x^{4}+o(x^{4})=-\\dfrac{4}{3}x^{4}+o(x^{4})$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>除以 $x^{4}$ 并令 $x\\to0$：$-\\dfrac{4}{3}+\\dfrac{o(x^{4})}{x^{4}}\\to-\\dfrac{4}{3}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：三处高频失分：① <b>展开阶数不足</b>——只写到 $x^{2}$ 项，低阶项相消后无法判断，容易误得 $0$；② 用等价无穷小替代泰勒（如把 $\\cos 2x$ 只换成 $1-\\frac{(2x)^{2}}{2}$），丢掉了 $x^{4}$ 项；③ 展开到 $x^{4}$ 却漏写余项 $o(x^{4})$，严格性不足。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$-\\dfrac43$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["常见函数的泰勒展开","等价无穷小"],"answerText":"展开到 $x^{4}$ 项：$\\cos 2x=1-2x^{2}+\\frac{2}{3}x^{4}+o(x^{4})$，$e^{-2x^{2}}=1-2x^{2}+2x^{4}+o(x^{4})$。相减得 $\\cos 2x-e^{-2x^{2}}=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}-2\\right)x^{4}+o(x^{4})=-\\frac{4}{3}x^{4}+o(x^{4})$。故原式 $=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(-\\frac{4}{3}+\\frac{o(x^{4})}{x^{4}}\\right)=-\\frac{4}{3}$。","knowledgeTags":["泰勒公式"],"kpId":"kp-t1-15"},"calc-orig-t1-16":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-16","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"函数 $f(x)=x^{3}-3x^{2}+3x$ 在 $x=1$ 处（　）。","options":["取得极大值","取得极小值","单调性发生改变","不取得极值"],"answer":3,"knowledge":"函数单调性与极值","hint":"先求 $f'(x)$ 并因式分解，看它在 $x=1$ 两侧的符号：若两侧同号，那么即使 $f'(1)=0$，该点也不是极值点。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：判定极值的完整流程：先找出 $f'=0$ 的点与 $f'$ 不存在的点（这些都是「可疑点」），再用一阶导数在这些点两侧是否变号来定论——变号才是极值点。也可用二阶导数判别法，但前提是 $f'(x_0)=0$ 且 $f''(x_0)\\ne0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>求导并因式分解：$f'(x)=3x^{2}-6x+3=3(x-1)^{2}$，对一切 $x$ 都有 $f'(x)\\ge0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>故 $f$ 在 $\\mathbb{R}$ 上单调递增；虽然 $f'(1)=0$，但导函数在 $x=1$ 的两侧都为正（只在 $x=1$ 处取到 $0$），<b>符号没有改变</b>。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>极值点要求导函数在两侧变号，这里不满足，故 $x=1$ 不是极值点，它只是单调区间内部的一个驻点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>也可改写 $f(x)=(x-1)^{3}+1$：$x^{3}$ 单调递增，平移后仍单调递增，既无极大值也无极小值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最典型的错误是<b>把驻点当成极值点</b>：看到 $f'(1)=0$ 就断定 $x=1$ 是极值点。判定的关键是导函数在 $x=1$ 两侧<b>是否变号</b>；本题 $f'(x)\\ge0$ 恒成立、不变号，故不是极值点。此外还要记住 $f'$ 不存在的点也可能是极值点，不能只盯着 $f'=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：不取得极值（$x=1$ 是驻点但不是极值点）。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["导数与单调性","极值的判定"],"knowledgeTags":["函数单调性与极值"],"kpId":"kp-t1-16"},"calc-orig-t1-17":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-17","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"曲线 $y=x^{4}-2x^{3}$ 的拐点共有（　）。","options":["无拐点","只有 $(1,-1)$","$(0,0)$ 与 $(1,-1)$","只有 $(0,0)$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"曲线的凹凸性与拐点","hint":"拐点是曲线凹凸性改变的点。先求 $y''$ 并因式分解，解出 $y''=0$ 的点；再逐点检查 $y''$ 在两侧是否变号——只有变号才是拐点。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：求拐点的标准三步：求 $y''$ → 解 $y''=0$ 并找出 $y''$ 不存在的点 → 逐点检查 $y''$ 两侧是否变号。只有变号的点才是拐点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$y'=4x^{3}-6x^{2}$，$y''=12x^{2}-12x=12x(x-1)$。令 $y''=0$ 得 $x=0$ 与 $x=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>讨论符号：当 $x<0$ 时 $y''>0$（曲线凹）；当 $0<x<1$ 时 $y''<0$（曲线凸）；当 $x>1$ 时 $y''>0$（曲线凹）。两个点两侧符号都发生了改变。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>故 $x=0$ 与 $x=1$ 都是拐点的横坐标，对应点为 $(0,0)$ 与 $(1,-1)$。$y''$ 处处存在，无需另找 $y''$ 不存在的点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两类常见错误：① <b>凹凸方向记反</b>——按考研大纲的约定，$f''>0$ 对应曲线是<b>凹</b>的（凹向上）、$f''<0$ 对应<b>凸</b>的，不要按日常语感颠倒；② 求出 $y''=0$ 的点就直接当拐点，<b>漏掉「两侧必须变号」这一验证</b>（例如 $y=x^{4}$ 虽有 $y''(0)=0$，但 $x=0$ 并不是拐点）。另外，$y''$ 不存在的点也要一并检查。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$(0,0)$ 与 $(1,-1)$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["二阶导数","凹凸性与拐点的判定"],"knowledgeTags":["曲线的凹凸性与拐点"],"kpId":"kp-t1-17"},"calc-orig-t1-18":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-18","topic":1,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"曲线 $y=\\dfrac{x^{2}}{x-1}$ 的所有渐近线是（　）。","options":["只有 $x=1$","只有 $y=x$","只有 $y=x+1$","$x=1$ 与 $y=x+1$"],"answer":3,"knowledge":"渐近线与函数作图","hint":"渐近线要分三种逐一排查：分母为零处看有没有铅直渐近线；$x\\to\\pm\\infty$ 时先看有没有水平渐近线（$y$ 是否趋于常数），若没有，再试斜渐近线（做除法或求斜率）。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：渐近线三条线索逐一排查：① 函数无定义且趋于无穷的点 → 铅直渐近线；② $x\\to\\pm\\infty$ 时 $y$ 趋于常数 → 水平渐近线；③ 水平渐近线不存在时，求 $k=\\lim\\frac{f(x)}{x}$ 与 $b=\\lim\\left(f(x)-kx\\right)$，若两者都是有限常数，则 $y=kx+b$ 是斜渐近线。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>铅直渐近线：在 $x=1$ 处分母为零而分子不为零，$\\dfrac{x^{2}}{x-1}\\to\\infty$，故 $x=1$ 是铅直渐近线。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>水平渐近线：当 $x\\to\\pm\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac{x^{2}}{x-1}\\to\\pm\\infty$，不趋于常数，故没有水平渐近线。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>斜渐近线：做除法 $\\dfrac{x^{2}}{x-1}=x+1+\\dfrac{1}{x-1}$，其中 $\\dfrac{1}{x-1}\\to0$，故 $y=x+1$ 是斜渐近线（也可用 $k=\\lim\\frac{y}{x}=1$、$b=\\lim\\left(y-kx\\right)=1$ 求出）。注意 $y=x$ 不是渐近线。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>综上，共有 $x=1$ 与 $y=x+1$ 两条渐近线。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：最典型的错误是<b>漏求斜渐近线</b>：当水平渐近线不存在（本题 $x\\to\\infty$ 时 $y\\to\\infty$）时，必须再检验是否存在斜渐近线，办法就是求 $k=\\lim\\frac{f(x)}{x}$ 与 $b=\\lim\\left(f(x)-kx\\right)$。另一处错误是把 $y=x$ 当成渐近线（只取首项、忽略了 $-1$ 带来的常数修正），或漏掉铅直渐近线。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$x=1$ 与 $y=x+1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["斜渐近线的求法","函数的极限"],"knowledgeTags":["渐近线与函数作图"],"kpId":"kp-t1-18"},"calc-orig-t1-19":{"id":"calc-orig-t1-19","topic":1,"level":"基础","type":"fill","prompt":"曲线 $y=\\ln(\\cos x)$ 在点 $(0,0)$ 处的曲率半径 $R=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"曲率与曲率半径","hint":"先求 $y'$ 与 $y''$ 在 $x=0$ 处的值，再套曲率公式 $K=\\frac{\\lvert y''\\rvert}{(1+y'^{2})^{3/2}}$ 求出曲率，最后取倒数得曲率半径。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：曲率半径的固定流程：求 $y'$、$y''$ → 代入 $K=\\frac{\\lvert y''\\rvert}{(1+y'^{2})^{3/2}}$ → 取倒数得 $R=\\frac{1}{K}$。若曲线以参数方程给出，则用 $K=\\frac{\\lvert x'y''-y'x''\\rvert}{(x'^{2}+y'^{2})^{3/2}}$，不要误用直角坐标公式。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>求导：$y'=-\\dfrac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}=-\\tan x$，$y''=-\\sec^{2}x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>在 $x=0$ 处：$y'=-\\tan0=0$，$y''=-\\sec^{2}0=-1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>曲率 $K=\\dfrac{\\lvert y''\\rvert}{\\left(1+y'^{2}\\right)^{3/2}}=\\dfrac{\\lvert-1\\rvert}{\\left(1+0\\right)^{3/2}}=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>曲率半径 $R=\\dfrac{1}{K}=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：两处常见错误：① <b>忘记取绝对值</b>，把 $K$ 算成 $-1$（曲率为非负量，公式中 $y''$ 必须加绝对值）；② 把曲率与曲率半径混为一谈——题目问的是 $R$，应为 $\\frac{1}{K}$，不要直接把 $K$ 填进去。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$R=1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2"],"chapter":"一元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["导数的计算","曲率公式"],"answers":["1","$1$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：1 / $1$","knowledgeTags":["曲率与曲率半径"],"kpId":"kp-t1-19"},"calc-orig-t2-09":{"id":"calc-orig-t2-09","topic":2,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"设 $I_1=\\int_0^1 x^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$，$I_2=\\int_0^1 x^3\\,\\mathrm{d}x$，$I_3=\\int_0^1\\sqrt{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$，则 $I_1,I_2,I_3$ 的大小关系是：","options":["$I_1<I_2<I_3$","$I_3<I_2<I_1$","$I_2<I_1<I_3$","$I_1<I_3<I_2$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"定积分的概念与性质","hint":"在 $[0,1]$ 上先比较三个被积函数的大小，再用「被积函数大则积分大」这一性质，无需逐个算出积分值。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：比较定积分大小不必求值：先在同一区间上比较被积函数，再用保号性「大函数的积分大」。使用前确认两个函数在该区间上都可积。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>当 $0\\le x\\le1$ 时，$x^3\\le x^2\\le\\sqrt{x}$（例如 $x=0.25$：$0.0156<0.0625<0.5$），且不等式在区间上不处处取等。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由定积分的保号性：若在 $[a,b]$ 上 $g(x)\\le f(x)$ 且 $g\\not\\equiv f$，则 $\\int_a^b g<\\int_a^b f$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>于是 $\\int_0^1x^3\\,\\mathrm{d}x<\\int_0^1x^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x<\\int_0^1\\sqrt{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x$，即 $I_2<I_1<I_3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>核对：$I_1=\\frac13\\approx0.333$，$I_2=\\frac14=0.25$，$I_3=\\frac23\\approx0.667$，与不等式一致。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：① <b>忘记前提就直接比较</b>——保号性要求被积函数在闭区间上有界、积分存在；本题三者都是初等函数、在 $[0,1]$ 上连续，前提自动满足。② 误把「某点处大」当作「积分大」：必须在整个区间上（几乎处处）成立不等式才可比较，本题 $x^3\\le x^2\\le\\sqrt{x}$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上处处成立，才能直接下结论。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$I_2<I_1<I_3$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["定积分的定义","定积分的保号性"],"knowledgeTags":["定积分的概念与性质"],"kpId":"kp-t2-09"},"calc-orig-t2-10":{"id":"calc-orig-t2-10","topic":2,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"设 $f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续，且 $\\int_0^1 f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=2$。则下列结论中<b>必定成立</b>的是：","options":["存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$，使 $f(\\xi)=2$","存在唯一的 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$，使 $f(\\xi)=2$","对任意 $x\\in[0,1]$，都有 $f(x)\\le2$","存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$，使 $f'(\\xi)=0$"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"定积分中值定理","hint":"见到「连续 + 已知定积分值 + 问某点函数值」，先想到定积分中值定理，把积分值换成 $f(\\xi)$；含「唯一」「上界」「导数」字样的选项再用反例逐个排除。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：定积分中值定理把「积分值」翻译成「某点的函数值」：$\\int_a^b f=f(\\xi)(b-a)$，$\\xi$ 可取在开区间内（$f$ 连续时）。再用反例排除含「唯一」「处处不超过」「导数」的干扰项。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>由定积分中值定理：$f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续，故存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$ 使 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=f(\\xi)(1-0)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>代入已知值得 $f(\\xi)=2$，故 A 必定成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>B 不成立：取 $f(x)\\equiv2$，则区间内每一点都有 $f=2$，$\\xi$ 并不唯一。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>C 不成立：取 $f(x)=4x$，则 $\\int_0^1f=2$，但 $f(1)=4>2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>D 不成立：题设只给连续性、未给可导性；即便可导（如 $f(x)=4x$），也有 $f'(x)\\equiv4\\ne0$，不存在这样的 $\\xi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：<b>把中值定理的 $\\xi$ 当作唯一或可任意指定</b>是最大陷阱：定理只保证「存在」，不保证唯一（A 对、B 错）。C 最易误选——积分等于 2 只说「平均值」是 2，并不限制 $f$ 处处不超过 2（$f(x)=4x$ 即反例）。D 则忘了定理前提是连续，本题未设可导。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：A。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["定积分的概念与性质","连续函数的介值性"],"knowledgeTags":["定积分中值定理"],"kpId":"kp-t2-10"},"calc-orig-t2-11":{"id":"calc-orig-t2-11","topic":2,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\int\\frac{x+2}{x^2+x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=$（$C$ 为任意常数）","options":["$\\ln\\left|\\frac{x}{x+1}\\right|+C$","$\\ln\\left|\\frac{x^2}{x+1}\\right|+C$","$\\ln|x^2+x|+C$","$\\frac12\\ln\\left|\\frac{x^2}{x+1}\\right|+C$"],"answer":1,"knowledge":"有理函数与三角有理式积分","hint":"有理分式先因式分解、再拆部分分式；分母 $x^2+x=x(x+1)$，设 $\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{x+1}$ 通分比较系数。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：有理分式的标准流程：分母因式分解 → 设部分分式 → 通分比较系数解出 $A,B$ → 逐项积成对数 → 用对数运算法则合并。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>因式分解并拆项：$\\frac{x+2}{x(x+1)}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{x+1}$，其中 $A(x+1)+Bx=x+2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>比较系数：$A+B=1$，$A=2$，解得 $A=2,\\ B=-1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>逐项积分：$\\int\\left(\\frac2x-\\frac1{x+1}\\right)\\mathrm{d}x=2\\ln|x|-\\ln|x+1|+C$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>合并对数：$2\\ln|x|-\\ln|x+1|=\\ln\\frac{|x|^2}{|x+1|}=\\ln\\left|\\frac{x^2}{x+1}\\right|$，即所选结果。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：① <b>部分分式系数解错</b>：本题分子是 $x+2$ 不是常数，若照搬 $\\frac{2}{x}-\\frac{2}{x+1}$ 就错了，必须服从 $A(x+1)+Bx=x+2$。② <b>漏写绝对值</b>：$\\int\\frac{1}{x}\\mathrm{d}x=\\ln|x|+C$。③ 干扰项 $\\ln|x^2+x|$ 相当于系数「1,1」，与本题的「2,−1」不是一回事，切勿混同。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\ln\\left|\\frac{x^2}{x+1}\\right|+C$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["基本积分公式与不定积分","部分分式分解"],"knowledgeTags":["有理函数与三角有理式积分"],"kpId":"kp-t2-11"},"calc-orig-t2-12":{"id":"calc-orig-t2-12","topic":2,"level":"强化","type":"solve","prompt":"求由曲线 $y=x^2$ 与直线 $y=x$ 所围成的平面图形绕 $x$ 轴旋转一周所得旋转体的体积 $V$。","knowledge":"定积分的几何应用","hint":"先求交点定出积分区间，再判断上下曲线，绕 $x$ 轴用圆环法体积公式。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：旋转体体积的固定流程：求交点定积分区间 → 判断上下曲线 → 绕 $x$ 轴用 $V=\\pi\\int_a^b\\left(y_{\\text{上}}^2-y_{\\text{下}}^2\\right)\\mathrm{d}x$（圆环法／垫片法）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>求交点：由 $x^2=x$ 得 $x=0$ 与 $x=1$，积分区间为 $[0,1]$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>在 $[0,1]$ 上 $x\\ge x^2$，故图形上方是 $y=x$、下方是 $y=x^2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>绕 $x$ 轴旋转用圆环法：$V=\\pi\\int_0^1\\left[x^2-(x^2)^2\\right]\\mathrm{d}x=\\pi\\int_0^1\\left(x^2-x^4\\right)\\mathrm{d}x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>计算：$\\pi\\left[\\frac{x^3}{3}-\\frac{x^5}{5}\\right]_0^1=\\pi\\left(\\frac13-\\frac15\\right)=\\frac{2\\pi}{15}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>（本题明确绕 $x$ 轴，用 $\\pi\\int_a^b\\left(y_{\\text{上}}^2-y_{\\text{下}}^2\\right)\\mathrm{d}x$；若绕 $y$ 轴则公式不同。）</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：<b>公式写反或漏平方</b>是最高频错误：绕 $x$ 轴必须是「先平方再相减」$\\pi\\int(y_{\\text{上}}^2-y_{\\text{下}}^2)\\mathrm{d}x$，写成 $\\pi\\int(y_{\\text{上}}-y_{\\text{下}})\\mathrm{d}x$ 求的是面积不是体积。另一坑是把 $y_{\\text{下}}=x^2$ 误当上曲线，得出 $(x^4-x^2)$，体积会变负——体积不可能为负，可借此自查。若题目改为绕 $y$ 轴，切勿照搬本公式。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$V=\\frac{2\\pi}{15}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":10,"prerequisites":["定积分的概念与性质","平面图形的面积"],"answerText":"$V=\\dfrac{2\\pi}{15}$。","knowledgeTags":["定积分的几何应用"],"kpId":"kp-t2-12"},"calc-orig-t2-13":{"id":"calc-orig-t2-13","topic":2,"level":"强化","type":"solve","prompt":"一圆柱形水桶高 $2\\,\\mathrm{m}$、底面半径 $1\\,\\mathrm{m}$，桶内盛满水。现将桶内的水全部抽到桶口以上 $1\\,\\mathrm{m}$ 处，求所需做的功 $W$。（取水的密度 $\\rho=1000\\,\\mathrm{kg/m^3}$，重力加速度 $g=10\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}$，结果可用 $\\pi$ 表示。）","knowledge":"定积分的物理应用","hint":"用微元法：取一层薄水，其重力为「力」，提升高度随深度变化，必须写成位置的函数再积分。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：物理应用的核心是「取微元」：把随位置变化的量写成位置变量的函数。变力做功 $\\mathrm{d}W=F(x)\\mathrm{d}x$，本题的「力」是该层水的重力，而提升高度也随深度变化，故必须写成 $(3-x)$ 再积分。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>以桶底为原点、向上为 $x$ 轴，在深度 $x$ 处取厚 $\\mathrm{d}x$ 的一层水，其体积 $\\mathrm{d}V=\\pi\\cdot1^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\pi\\,\\mathrm{d}x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>该层水的质量 $\\mathrm{d}m=\\rho\\,\\mathrm{d}V=1000\\pi\\,\\mathrm{d}x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>这一层要被提升到桶口以上 $1\\,\\mathrm{m}$ 处，提升高度为 $(2-x)+1=3-x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>该层所需做的功 $\\mathrm{d}W=\\mathrm{d}m\\cdot g\\cdot(3-x)=1000\\pi\\cdot10\\cdot(3-x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=10^{4}\\pi(3-x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>对全桶积分：$W=\\int_0^2 10^{4}\\pi(3-x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=10^{4}\\pi\\left[3x-\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right]_0^2=10^{4}\\pi(6-2)=4\\times10^{4}\\pi$（J）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：① <b>把提升高度当成常数</b>是最典型错误——水层越深、要提得越高，高度 $(3-x)$ 必须随位置变化，若一律按 $1\\,\\mathrm{m}$ 或 $3\\,\\mathrm{m}$ 计算就错了。② 微元层次混淆：$\\mathrm{d}V=\\pi r^2\\mathrm{d}x$ 中的 $r=1$ 是底面半径，不要误用直径。③ 量纲检查：$\\rho g\\,\\mathrm{d}V$ 是力（N），再乘提升高度（m）才是功（J），结果 $4\\times10^4\\pi\\ \\mathrm{J}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$W=4\\times10^{4}\\pi\\ \\mathrm{J}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["定积分的概念与性质","定积分的几何应用"],"answerText":"$W=4\\times10^{4}\\pi\\ \\mathrm{J}$（即 $40000\\pi\\ \\mathrm{J}$）。","knowledgeTags":["定积分的物理应用"],"kpId":"kp-t2-13"},"calc-orig-t2-14":{"id":"calc-orig-t2-14","topic":2,"level":"基础","type":"fill","prompt":"函数 $f(x)=x^2$ 在区间 $[0,3]$ 上的平均值 $\\bar f=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"函数在区间上的平均值","hint":"连续函数在 $[a,b]$ 上的平均值等于「积分值除以区间长度」，先算定积分再除以 $b-a$。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：平均值 = 积分值 ÷ 区间长度：$\\bar f=\\frac{1}{b-a}\\int_a^b f$。先算定积分，再除以 $b-a$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>连续函数在 $[a,b]$ 上的平均值定义为 $\\bar f=\\frac{1}{b-a}\\int_a^b f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>这里 $a=0,\\ b=3$，故 $\\bar f=\\frac{1}{3}\\int_0^3 x^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>$\\int_0^3x^2\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\left[\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^3=9$，所以 $\\bar f=\\frac{9}{3}=3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：<b>忘记除以区间长度 $(b-a)$</b> 是本题唯一也是最高频的错误：算出 $\\int_0^3x^2\\mathrm{d}x=9$ 后直接填 9。另需注意是 $b-a=3$ 而不是 $b=3$——本题两者恰好相等，一旦区间换成 $[1,3]$ 这个混淆就会暴露。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\bar f=3$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"一元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["定积分的概念与性质"],"answers":["3","$3$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：3 / $3$（只填数值）","knowledgeTags":["函数在区间上的平均值"],"kpId":"kp-t2-14"},"calc-orig-t3-08":{"id":"calc-orig-t3-08","topic":3,"level":"基础","type":"choice","prompt":"$\\lim\\limits_{(x,y)\\to(0,0)}\\dfrac{xy}{x^{2}+y^{2}}$ 的值是：","options":["$0$","$\\dfrac{1}{2}$","不存在","$\\dfrac{1}{4}$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"二元函数的极限与连续","hint":"判二重极限「不存在」只需找两条路径给出不同结果：先沿 $x$ 轴算，再沿 $y=x$ 算，比较两者。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：判断二重极限不存在，只需找出两条路径给出不同的极限值；若要判断存在，则必须证明与路径无关（通常用夹逼或极坐标放缩），绝不能只算一两条路径就下结论。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>沿 $y=0$（$x$ 轴）趋近原点：$\\dfrac{x\\cdot0}{x^{2}+0}=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>沿 $y=x$ 趋近原点：$\\dfrac{x^{2}}{x^{2}+x^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>两条路径得到的值不同（$0\\ne\\frac12$），故二重极限不存在。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>更一般地沿 $y=kx$ 趋近得 $\\dfrac{k}{1+k^{2}}$，随 $k$ 变化，说明极限与路径有关。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：<b>只用一条路径就宣布极限存在</b>是最致命的错误：本题若只沿 $x$ 轴算得 0，就会误选「0」。判断存在的标准是「沿任意路径都趋于同一值」，所以要主动尝试 $y=x$、$y=kx$、$y=x^{2}$ 等不同路径；只要有一对路径结果不同，即可断言极限不存在。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：不存在。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["一元函数极限","二元函数的定义"],"knowledgeTags":["二元函数的极限与连续"],"kpId":"kp-t3-08"},"calc-orig-t3-09":{"id":"calc-orig-t3-09","topic":3,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"设 $z=z(x,y)$ 由方程 $x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}=6$ 确定，则 $\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}$ 在点 $(2,1,1)$ 处的值为____（填数值）。","knowledge":"多元隐函数求导","hint":"写成 $F(x,y,z)=0$ 的形式，用隐函数求导公式 $\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z}$，先验 $F_z\\ne0$ 再代值。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：由 $F(x,y,z)=0$ 确定的隐函数：$\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z}$、$\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}=-\\frac{F_y}{F_z}$。先验证 $F_z\\ne0$，再代入求解。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>令 $F(x,y,z)=x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}-6$，则 $F_x=2x$，$F_z=2z$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由隐函数求导公式：$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=-\\dfrac{F_x}{F_z}=-\\dfrac{2x}{2z}=-\\dfrac{x}{z}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>代入 $(x,y,z)=(2,1,1)$：$-\\dfrac{2}{1}=-2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>前提检查：该点 $F_z=2z=2\\ne0$，公式适用。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：① <b>漏掉公式里的负号</b>——写成 $\\frac{F_x}{F_z}$ 会得到 $2$。② 求 $F_x$ 时把 $z$ 也当自变量：在 $F$ 的框架下 $F$ 是三元函数，$F_x$ 只对第一个位置求导，不要擅自链式展开。③ 忘记验证 $F_z\\ne0$（本题 $F_z=2z$，在 $z=0$ 处公式失效）。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$-2$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["偏导数计算","隐函数存在定理"],"answers":["-2","$-2$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：-2 / $-2$（只填数值）","knowledgeTags":["多元隐函数求导"],"kpId":"kp-t3-09"},"calc-orig-t3-10":{"id":"calc-orig-t3-10","topic":3,"level":"基础","type":"fill","prompt":"空间曲线 $x=t^{2},\\ y=t,\\ z=t^{3}$ 在 $t=1$ 对应点处的法平面方程为 $2x+y+3z=d$，则 $d=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"空间曲线的切线与法平面","hint":"先求切向量（对参数求导），法平面以切向量为法向量，再写出点法式方程并整理出常数项。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：参数式曲线：切向量就是对参数求导所得的向量；法平面以该切向量为法向量，过曲线上该点写点法式即可。若曲线以一般式（两曲面交线）给出，切向量取两法向量 $\\vec n_1\\times\\vec n_2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>求切向量：$x'=2t,\\ y'=1,\\ z'=3t^{2}$，在 $t=1$ 处得 $\\vec T=(2,1,3)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>求点坐标：$t=1$ 时 $x=1,\\ y=1,\\ z=1$，即点 $(1,1,1)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>法平面以切向量为法向量，过 $(1,1,1)$：$2(x-1)+(y-1)+3(z-1)=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>整理得 $2x+y+3z=6$，故 $d=6$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>（若曲线以两曲面交线的一般式给出，切向量须取两法向量的叉积 $\\vec n_1\\times\\vec n_2$。）</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：① <b>把切线与法平面的角色搞混</b>：切线的方向向量同时也是法平面的法向量，但切平面的法向量与法线的方向是两回事，不要互相套用。② 一般式给曲线时必须用叉积 $\\vec n_1\\times\\vec n_2$ 求切向量，直接拿某个曲面的法向量当切向量是错的。③ 点法式中的点要取 $t=1$ 时的 $(1,1,1)$，不要直接把参数表达式 $(t^{2},t,t^{3})$ 代入。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$d=6$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["参数方程求导","平面的点法式方程"],"answers":["6","$6$"],"answerNote":"等价写法：6 / $6$（只填数值）","knowledgeTags":["空间曲线的切线与法平面"],"kpId":"kp-t3-10"},"calc-orig-t3-11":{"id":"calc-orig-t3-11","topic":3,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"求表面积为 $a^{2}$ 的长方体的最大体积。","knowledge":"条件极值与拉格朗日乘数法","hint":"设长宽高为变量，写出体积（目标）与表面积（约束），构造拉格朗日函数后用「相减消 $\\lambda$」解方程组。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：条件极值的标准流程：设变量与目标函数 → 写约束 → 构造拉格朗日函数 $L=f+\\mu g$ → 令各偏导为零解方程组（常用「两式相减消 $\\mu$」） → 代回求值 → 用实际意义说明唯一驻点即最值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>设长方体的长、宽、高分别为 $x,y,z$（均 $>0$），目标函数 $V=xyz$，约束条件 $2(xy+yz+zx)=a^{2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>构造拉格朗日函数 $L=xyz+\\mu\\,(xy+yz+zx)$（常数 $2$ 已并入 $\\mu$），令各偏导为零：</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>$L_x=yz+\\mu(y+z)=0$，$L_y=xz+\\mu(x+z)=0$，$L_z=xy+\\mu(x+y)=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>两式相减：由 $L_x-L_y=(y-x)(z+\\mu)=0$，同理 $(z-y)(x+\\mu)=0$、$(x-z)(y+\\mu)=0$；若 $x,y,z$ 不全相等，则推出 $\\mu=-x=-y=-z$，与三式全等的情形矛盾，故只能 $x=y=z$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>代入约束：$2\\cdot3x^{2}=a^{2}$，得 $x^{2}=\\dfrac{a^{2}}{6}$，即 $x=y=z=\\dfrac{a}{\\sqrt{6}}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">6</span><div>于是 $V_{\\max}=x^{3}=\\left(\\dfrac{a}{\\sqrt{6}}\\right)^{3}=\\dfrac{a^{3}}{6\\sqrt{6}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{6}}{36}a^{3}$；由实际意义（唯一驻点）知此即最大值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：① <b>解出驻点后忘记说明它就是最值</b>：一般需借助实际问题「最大值存在且驻点唯一」来补上这一步，不能只写「解得 $x=y=z$」就收尾。② 目标与约束写反，把 $2(xy+yz+zx)=a^{2}$ 当成要最大化的对象。③ 忽略 $x,y,z>0$ 的隐含条件，导致丢解或引入无意义的负根。④ 只给体积值而不给出取到最值的长宽高。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$V_{\\max}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{6}}{36}a^{3}$（当 $x=y=z=\\dfrac{a}{\\sqrt{6}}$ 时取到）。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-12"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数微分学","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["多元函数极值与驻点","多元复合函数求导"],"answerText":"$V_{\\max}=\\dfrac{a^{3}}{6\\sqrt{6}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{6}}{36}a^{3}$，此时长、宽、高均为 $\\dfrac{a}{\\sqrt{6}}$（即正方体）。","knowledgeTags":["条件极值与拉格朗日乘数法"],"kpId":"kp-t3-11"},"calc-orig-t4-06":{"id":"calc-orig-t4-06","topic":4,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"设 $D=[0,2]\\times[0,3]$，函数 $f$ 在 $D$ 上连续，且 $1\\le f(x,y)\\le3$。记 $I=\\iint_D f(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{d}A$。下列结论必然正确的是：","options":["$1\\le I\\le3$","存在 $(\\xi,\\eta)\\in D$，使 $I=6f(\\xi,\\eta)$，且 $6\\le I\\le18$","$I=6f(1,\\frac32)$","存在 $(\\xi,\\eta)\\in D$，使 $I=f(\\xi,\\eta)$"],"answer":1,"knowledge":"二重积分的性质与中值定理","hint":"先求矩形的面积，再对不等式两端在 $D$ 上积分；中值定理给出某个点，而不会指定它恰是矩形中心。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：积分估值与中值定理都要乘区域面积：先求面积，再用积分保序性定范围，用连续性保证存在中值点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$D$ 的面积为 $\\sigma=2\\times3=6$。$f$ 连续，故在有界闭区域 $D$ 上可积，积分中值定理适用。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>对 $1\\le f\\le3$ 积分，得 $\\iint_D1\\,\\mathrm{d}A\\le I\\le\\iint_D3\\,\\mathrm{d}A$，即 $6\\le I\\le18$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>由二重积分中值定理，存在 $(\\xi,\\eta)\\in D$ 使 $I=\\sigma f(\\xi,\\eta)=6f(\\xi,\\eta)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>排除其余结论：取 $f\\equiv1$，则 $I=6$，已否定 $1\\le I\\le3$ 及 $I=f(\\xi,\\eta)$。取 $f(x,y)=1+\\frac{x^2}{2}$，符合 $1\\le f\\le3$，但 $I=10$，而 $6f(1,\\frac32)=9$，故中值点不能指定为中心。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：漏乘区域面积会误选 $1\\le I\\le3$ 或 $I=f(\\xi,\\eta)$。中值定理只保证某个点存在，并不保证它位于区域中心。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：存在 $(\\xi,\\eta)\\in D$ 使 $I=6f(\\xi,\\eta)$，且 $6\\le I\\le18$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["二重积分的概念","连续函数的性质"],"knowledgeTags":["二重积分的性质与中值定理"],"kpId":"kp-t4-06"},"calc-orig-t4-07":{"id":"calc-orig-t4-07","topic":4,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"设 $\\Omega=\\{(x,y,z):x^2+y^2+z^2\\le4,\\ z\\ge0\\}$。用球面坐标计算 $\\iiint_\\Omega z^2\\,\\mathrm{d}V$，并写出坐标范围与体积元素。","knowledge":"三重积分","hint":"把 $z$ 写成球面坐标中径向变量与极角的乘积；上半球限制的是极角范围，体积元素还含两个雅可比因子。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：球域适合球面坐标。先固定极角从正 $z$ 轴量起的约定，再写上半球范围；把被积函数与雅可比一起换元后分离三个积分。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>取 $x=\\rho\\sin\\varphi\\cos\\theta$，$y=\\rho\\sin\\varphi\\sin\\theta$，$z=\\rho\\cos\\varphi$。区域为 $0\\le\\rho\\le2$，$0\\le\\varphi\\le\\frac\\pi2$，$0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>球面坐标体积元素为 $\\mathrm{d}V=\\rho^2\\sin\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\rho\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta$，被积函数 $z^2=\\rho^2\\cos^2\\varphi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>所求积分 $=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\mathrm{d}\\theta\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^2\\varphi\\sin\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varphi\\int_0^2\\rho^4\\,\\mathrm{d}\\rho$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>三个因子分别为 $2\\pi$、$[-\\frac13\\cos^3\\varphi]_0^{\\pi/2}=\\frac13$、$[\\frac15\\rho^5]_0^2=\\frac{32}{5}$，乘积为 $\\frac{64\\pi}{15}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：漏掉 $\\rho^2\\sin\\varphi$ 会改变积分值；把极角写成 $0\\le\\varphi\\le\\pi$ 会把下半球也算入，得到两倍结果。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\frac{64\\pi}{15}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["极坐标与区域表示","定积分计算"],"answerText":"$0\\le\\rho\\le2$，$0\\le\\varphi\\le\\frac\\pi2$，$0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$；$\\mathrm{d}V=\\rho^2\\sin\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\rho\\,\\mathrm{d}\\varphi\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta$；积分值为 $\\frac{64\\pi}{15}$。","knowledgeTags":["三重积分"],"kpId":"kp-t4-07"},"calc-orig-t4-08":{"id":"calc-orig-t4-08","topic":4,"level":"综合","type":"choice","prompt":"曲线 $L$ 由 $x=t,\\ y=2t$（$0\\le t\\le1$）给出，记 $-L$ 为反向曲线。则 $\\int_{-L}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s$ 与 $\\int_{-L}x\\,\\mathrm{d}y$ 分别为：","options":["$\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2},\\ 1$","$-\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2},\\ -1$","$1,\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}$","$\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2},\\ -1$"],"answer":3,"knowledge":"曲线积分","hint":"先沿 $L$ 参数化，分别写出弧长元素与坐标微分；再检查反向时第一类与第二类曲线积分的变化。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：两类曲线积分要分别参数化：弧长元素用导数向量的模，坐标微分用对应分量导数。最后利用第一类方向无关、第二类反向变号。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>沿 $L$ 有 $\\mathrm{d}s=\\sqrt{(x')^2+(y')^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\sqrt5\\,\\mathrm{d}t$，故 $\\int_Lx\\,\\mathrm{d}s=\\sqrt5\\int_0^1t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>第一类曲线积分与方向无关，因此 $\\int_{-L}x\\,\\mathrm{d}s=\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>沿 $L$ 有 $\\mathrm{d}y=2\\,\\mathrm{d}t$，故 $\\int_Lx\\,\\mathrm{d}y=\\int_0^{1}2t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=1$。第二类曲线积分反向变号，因此 $\\int_{-L}x\\,\\mathrm{d}y=-1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：把两类积分一同变号会得到 $(-\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2},-1)$；一同不变号会得到 $(\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2},1)$。弧长元素始终非负，不能当作带方向的坐标微分。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}$ 与 $-1$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":4,"prerequisites":["参数方程求导","定积分计算"],"knowledgeTags":["曲线积分"],"kpId":"kp-t4-08"},"calc-orig-t4-09":{"id":"calc-orig-t4-09","topic":4,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"设 $L$ 为椭圆 $\\frac{x^2}{4}+y^2=1$，沿顺时针方向。计算 $\\oint_L(x-y^3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x+(x^3+y)\\,\\mathrm{d}y$，并说明所用格林公式的方向条件。","knowledge":"格林公式与路径无关","hint":"先算 $Q_x-P_y$；注意曲线方向与格林公式正向是否一致。椭圆域可令 $x=2r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta$ 化为单位圆盘。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：先验证闭合曲线与区域内偏导连续，再确认方向；格林公式化成二重积分后，用椭圆的线性变换计算。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>令 $P=x-y^3$、$Q=x^3+y$。它们在整个平面有连续偏导，$L$ 是简单闭曲线，故可用格林公式。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>格林公式的正向是逆时针；本题顺时针，需取负号。$Q_x-P_y=3x^2-(-3y^2)=3(x^2+y^2)$，所以原积分 $=-3\\iint_D(x^2+y^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}A$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>令 $x=2r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta$，$0\\le r\\le1$、$0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$，雅可比为 $2r$。则 $\\iint_D(x^2+y^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}A=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^1 2r^3(4\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta)\\,\\mathrm{d}r\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>$\\int_0^1r^3\\,\\mathrm{d}r=\\frac14$，$\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\cos^2\\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\sin^2\\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta=\\pi$，故二重积分为 $2\\times\\frac14\\times5\\pi=\\frac{5\\pi}{2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>原积分 $=-3\\times\\frac{5\\pi}{2}=-\\frac{15\\pi}{2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：顺时针不是格林公式的正向，漏负号会得到相反结果；椭圆换元的雅可比为 $2r$，不能套单位圆的 $r$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$-\\frac{15\\pi}{2}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["二重积分计算","极坐标与区域表示"],"answerText":"顺时针需在格林公式前加负号；$Q_x-P_y=3(x^2+y^2)$，$\\iint_D(x^2+y^2)\\,\\mathrm{d}A=\\frac{5\\pi}{2}$，故原积分为 $-\\frac{15\\pi}{2}$。","knowledgeTags":["格林公式与路径无关"],"kpId":"kp-t4-09"},"calc-orig-t4-10":{"id":"calc-orig-t4-10","topic":4,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"设 $S$ 为上半球面 $x^2+y^2+z^2=1,\\ z\\ge0$，取球面外侧。计算曲面积分 $\\iint_S x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\mathrm{d}z+y\\,\\mathrm{d}z\\mathrm{d}x+(z+1)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y$。","knowledge":"曲面积分与高斯公式","hint":"球面尚未闭合，需要补上赤道圆盘；为闭曲面取外侧时，补面法向量应朝哪个方向？算完闭曲面通量再减去补面通量。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：非闭合曲面用高斯公式时，先补面使之闭合，并为全部曲面统一取外侧；所求等于闭曲面通量减补面通量。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>取向量场 $\\mathbf F=(x,y,z+1)$，在半球内部及边界有连续偏导，散度为 $1+1+1=3$。补圆盘 $S_0:z=0,x^2+y^2\\le1$，使 $S\\cup S_0$ 闭合。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>对半球底面而言，闭曲面的外侧指向下方，故 $S_0$ 的单位法向量为 $(0,0,-1)$。由高斯公式，闭曲面通量 $=\\iiint_\\Omega3\\,\\mathrm{d}V=3\\times\\frac{2\\pi}{3}=2\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>在 $S_0$ 上 $\\mathbf F\\cdot\\mathbf n=-1$，所以补面通量为 $-\\iint_{x^2+y^2\\le1}1\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y=-\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>原球面通量加补面通量等于 $2\\pi$，所以原积分 $=2\\pi-(-\\pi)=3\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：直接把半球面当闭曲面会误得 $2\\pi$；把补面法向取向上会算成 $\\pi$。补面属于半球底部，外法向必须朝下。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$3\\pi$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["三重积分","二重积分的几何意义"],"answerText":"补赤道圆盘并取向下外法向，散度为 $3$；闭曲面通量 $2\\pi$，补面通量 $-\\pi$，所求为 $2\\pi-(-\\pi)=3\\pi$。","knowledgeTags":["曲面积分与高斯公式"],"kpId":"kp-t4-10"},"calc-orig-t4-11":{"id":"calc-orig-t4-11","topic":4,"level":"基础","type":"fill","prompt":"设向量场 $\\mathbf F=(yz,xz,xy+z^2)$，其散度在点 $P(1,2,3)$ 处等于____（填数值）。","knowledge":"散度与旋度","hint":"散度是三个对应分量的偏导之和：第一分量对 $x$、第二分量对 $y$、第三分量对 $z$。求完再代入点坐标。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：按定义对三个分量各求一个对应偏导并相加，结果是标量，再代入指定点。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>由定义 $\\operatorname{div}\\mathbf F=\\frac{\\partial(yz)}{\\partial x}+\\frac{\\partial(xz)}{\\partial y}+\\frac{\\partial(xy+z^2)}{\\partial z}=0+0+2z=2z$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>代入 $z=3$，得到 $\\operatorname{div}\\mathbf F(1,2,3)=6$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：求偏导时必须固定其余变量，$yz$ 对 $x$、$xz$ 对 $y$ 都是常数；散度是标量，不能把三个偏导写成旋度式向量。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$6$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"多元函数积分学","estimatedMinutes":2,"prerequisites":["偏导数计算"],"answers":["6","$6$"],"answerNote":"只填散度数值。","knowledgeTags":["散度与旋度"],"kpId":"kp-t4-11"},"calc-orig-t5-04":{"id":"calc-orig-t5-04","topic":5,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"初值问题 $y'+y=xy^2,\\ y(0)=1$ 的解满足 $y(1)=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"齐次方程与伯努利方程","hint":"这是含 $y^2$ 的伯努利方程。在初值附近 $y\\ne0$，除以 $y^2$ 后令 $u=1/y$；注意 $u'$ 前的负号。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：伯努利方程先检查零解，再在非零分支令 $u=y^{1-n}$；本题 $n=2$，故令 $u=1/y$，化成一阶线性方程后代初值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>先注意 $y\\equiv0$ 是原方程的解，但不满足 $y(0)=1$。由初值与连续性，在 $0$ 附近可令 $u=\\frac1y$，此时 $u'=-\\frac{y'}{y^2}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>将方程除以 $y^2$ 得 $\\frac{y'}{y^2}+\\frac1y=x$，所以 $-u'+u=x$，即 $u'-u=-x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>乘积分因子 $e^{-x}$：$(ue^{-x})'=-xe^{-x}$。积分得 $ue^{-x}=(x+1)e^{-x}+C$，即 $u=x+1+Ce^x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>由 $u(0)=1$ 得 $1=1+C$，所以 $C=0$，$y=\\frac1{x+1}$。该式在包含 $0$ 的区间 $(-1,+\\infty)$ 上成立，故 $y(1)=\\frac12$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><div>验证：$y'+y=-\\frac1{(x+1)^2}+\\frac1{x+1}=\\frac{x}{(x+1)^2}=xy^2$，且 $y(0)=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：$u'=-y'/y^2$ 的负号不能漏；除以 $y^2$ 前须检查零解。虽然零解不符合本题初值，仍需明确说明以保证换元完整。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\frac12$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1","math-2"],"chapter":"常微分方程","estimatedMinutes":4,"prerequisites":["一阶线性微分方程","复合函数求导"],"answers":["1/2","0.5","\\frac12","\\frac{1}{2}"],"answerNote":"可填分数或小数。","knowledgeTags":["齐次方程与伯努利方程"],"kpId":"kp-t5-04"},"calc-orig-t5-05":{"id":"calc-orig-t5-05","topic":5,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"初值问题 $y''=(y')^2,\\ y(0)=0,\\ y'(0)=1$，在包含 $0$ 的最大解区间内，其解为：","options":["$y=-\\ln(1-x),\\quad x<1$","$y=\\ln(1+x),\\quad x>-1$","$y=-\\ln|1-x|,\\quad x\\ne1$","$y=e^x-1,\\quad x\\in\\mathbb R$"],"answer":0,"knowledge":"可降阶的高阶方程","hint":"方程中不含 $y$，令 $p=y'$ 后先求 $p(x)$；还原 $y$ 后检查包含初始点的最大连通区间。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：缺 $y$ 的二阶方程令 $p=y'$，把二阶变一阶；先用导数初值定 $p$，再积分并用函数初值定 $y$，最后确定最大连通解区间。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>令 $p=y'$，则 $p'=p^2$，$p(0)=1$。在初值附近 $p\\ne0$，分离变量：$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}p}{p^2}=\\mathrm{d}x$，得 $-\\frac1p=x+C_1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由 $p(0)=1$ 得 $C_1=-1$，所以 $y'=p=\\frac1{1-x}$。零分支 $p\\equiv0$ 不满足初值，已排除。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>积分得 $y=-\\ln|1-x|+C_2$，由 $y(0)=0$ 得 $C_2=0$。含 $0$ 的最大解区间为 $(-\\infty,1)$，其中 $1-x>0$，故 $y=-\\ln(1-x)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>验证 $y'=\\frac1{1-x}$，$y''=\\frac1{(1-x)^2}=(y')^2$；当 $x\\to1^-$ 时解发散，不能跨过 $x=1$。$x\\ne1$ 不是包含 $0$ 的一个连通解区间。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：本题 $p$ 是 $x$ 的函数，故 $y''=p'(x)$，不要套缺 $x$ 类型的 $p\\,\\mathrm{d}p/\\mathrm{d}y$。写 $x\\ne1$ 会混入不含初始点的另一分支区间。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$y=-\\ln(1-x)$，最大解区间为 $(-\\infty,1)$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1","math-2"],"chapter":"常微分方程","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["可分离变量方程","初始条件"],"knowledgeTags":["可降阶的高阶方程"],"kpId":"kp-t5-05"},"calc-orig-t5-06":{"id":"calc-orig-t5-06","topic":5,"level":"强化","type":"choice","prompt":"微分方程 $y''-4y'+4y=0$ 满足 $y(0)=1,\\ y'(0)=0$ 的解为：","options":["$e^{2x}$","$(1+2x)e^{2x}$","$(1-2x)e^{2x}$","$e^{-2x}$"],"answer":2,"knowledge":"二阶常系数齐次线性方程","hint":"先分解特征多项式并检查是否重根；重根对应的第二个基本解含 $x$，再把两条初值代入。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：二阶常系数齐次方程先求特征根；二重根 $r$ 对应 $(C_1+C_2x)e^{rx}$，写通解后同时代函数与导数初值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>特征方程 $r^2-4r+4=(r-2)^2=0$，有二重根 $r=2$，故通解为 $y=(C_1+C_2x)e^{2x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由 $y(0)=1$ 得 $C_1=1$。求导 $y'=(C_2+2C_1+2C_2x)e^{2x}$，由 $y'(0)=0$ 得 $C_2=-2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>于是 $y=(1-2x)e^{2x}$；$y'=-4xe^{2x}$，$y''=(-4-8x)e^{2x}$，代入 $y''-4y'+4y$ 为 $0$，且两条初值均成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：重根漏乘 $x$ 会只剩 $Ce^{2x}$，无法同时满足两条初值；定 $C_2$ 时须把乘积求导产生的 $2C_1$ 一并计入。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$(1-2x)e^{2x}$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"常微分方程","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["二阶线性方程的特征方程","初始条件"],"knowledgeTags":["二阶常系数齐次线性方程"],"kpId":"kp-t5-06"},"calc-orig-t5-07":{"id":"calc-orig-t5-07","topic":5,"level":"综合","type":"solve","prompt":"求初值问题 $y''-2y'+y=(x+1)e^x,\\ y(0)=0,\\ y'(0)=1$ 的解，写出齐次解与特解，并验证初始条件。","knowledge":"二阶常系数非齐次线性方程","hint":"右端的指数对应特征方程的几重根？先写齐次解，再按重数给待定系数特解补上相应的 $x$ 次幂。也可令 $y=e^xv$ 简化左端。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：指数的特征根重数决定待定系数法要补多少个 $x$：这里是二重根，故补 $x^2$。令 $y=e^xv$ 可把左端化为 $e^xv''$，便于算系数与验证。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>齐次特征方程为 $(r-1)^2=0$，所以 $y_h=(C_1+C_2x)e^x$。右端为一次多项式乘 $e^x$，且 $1$ 为二重根，特解应设为 $y_p=x^2(Ax+B)e^x$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>令 $y=e^xv$，则 $y''-2y'+y=e^xv''$。对特解有 $v_p=Ax^3+Bx^2$，$v_p''=6Ax+2B$；比较 $v_p''=x+1$ 得 $A=\\frac16$、$B=\\frac12$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>通解为 $y=e^x(C_1+C_2x+\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x^3}{6})$。由 $y(0)=0$ 得 $C_1=0$；$y'(0)=C_1+C_2=1$，得 $C_2=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>所以 $y=e^x(x+\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x^3}{6})$。记括号为 $v$，则 $v''=1+x$，直接验证方程成立；$v(0)=0$、$v'(0)=1$，故 $y(0)=0$、$y'(0)=v(0)+v'(0)=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：只设 $(Ax+B)e^x$ 会与齐次解重合；只补一个 $x$ 仍不足，因为 $1$ 是二重特征根。最后代 $y'(0)$ 时，不能漏掉指数因子求导产生的 $v(0)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$y=e^x(x+\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x^3}{6})$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1","math-2","math-3"],"chapter":"常微分方程","estimatedMinutes":12,"prerequisites":["二阶常系数齐次线性方程","待定系数法"],"answerText":"齐次解 $y_h=(C_1+C_2x)e^x$，特解 $y_p=(\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x^3}{6})e^x$。由初值得 $C_1=0,C_2=1$，故 $y=e^x(x+\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x^3}{6})$。","knowledgeTags":["二阶常系数非齐次线性方程"],"kpId":"kp-t5-07"},"calc-orig-t5-08":{"id":"calc-orig-t5-08","topic":5,"level":"强化","type":"fill","prompt":"当 $x>0$ 时，欧拉方程 $x^2y''-xy'+y=0$ 满足 $y(1)=1,\\ y'(1)=0$，其解在 $x=e$ 处的值 $y(e)=$____（填数值）。","knowledge":"欧拉方程","hint":"令 $t=\\ln x$，把 $xy'$ 与 $x^2y''$ 用 $Y(t)=y(e^t)$ 的导数表示；注意 $x^2y''$ 不等于 $Y''$，还要减去一项。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：欧拉方程在 $x>0$ 上作 $x=e^t$ 变换，用链式法则把变系数方程化为常系数方程，再还原变量并代初值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>因 $x>0$，令 $t=\\ln x$、$Y(t)=y(e^t)$。链式法则给出 $xy'=Y'$、$x^2y''=Y''-Y'$，原方程化为 $Y''-2Y'+Y=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>特征方程 $(r-1)^2=0$，故 $Y=(C_1+C_2t)e^t$，还原得 $y=x(C_1+C_2\\ln x)$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>$y(1)=C_1=1$，而 $y'=C_1+C_2(\\ln x+1)$，由 $y'(1)=0$ 得 $C_2=-1$。故 $y=x(1-\\ln x)$，$y(e)=e(1-1)=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><div>验证 $y'=-\\ln x$、$y''=-1/x$，代入原方程为 $-x+x\\ln x+x(1-\\ln x)=0$，两初值也成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：漏掉 $x^2y''=Y''-Y'$ 中的 $-Y'$ 会改变特征方程；重根还原后必须保留 $x\\ln x$ 这一基本解。题干已限定 $x>0$，无需延拓到负半轴。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$0$。</div></div>","source":{"kind":"原创","reference":"本项目 t0–t5 补题；考法参照 2010–2026 数一真题与《2026 考研数学考试大纲》标定，题干、数据、选项与解析均为自行编写","license":"原创题干与数据"},"review":{"status":"approved","reviewedAt":"2026-10-13"},"subject":["math-1"],"chapter":"常微分方程","estimatedMinutes":3,"prerequisites":["二阶常系数齐次线性方程","复合函数求导"],"answers":["0","$0$"],"answerNote":"只填 y(e) 的数值。","knowledgeTags":["欧拉方程"],"kpId":"kp-t5-08"}};
const expectedText={"calc-stage3-limit-0001":{"hint":"先检查已知商在 $x=0$ 时是否有意义。把 $f(x)-2$ 写成 $x$ 与已知商的乘积，考察趋近过程。最后检查题目是否给出连接极限与点值的连续条件。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：先从乘积极限得到趋近时的函数值，再区分「极限」与「点值」；用任意点值的例子检验条件能否唯一确定答案。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>当 $x\\ne0$ 时，$f(x)-2=x\\cdot\\frac{f(x)-2}{x}$。已知商趋于有限值 3，而 $x\\to0$，故 $\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>极限只取决于去心邻域的函数值。题目未给出 $0$ 处连续性，因此不能推出 $f(0)=\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)$，也不能把已知商当作 $f'(0)$ 的定义。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>例如任取常数 $c$，令 $f(x)=2+3x$（$x\\ne0$），$f(0)=c$。此时给定商恒为 3，但点值 $c$ 可以任意指定，故 $f(0)$ 无法确定。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：选 $2$ 是擅自补上连续性；选 $3$ 是把商的极限当作函数值。$0$ 也没有条件支持。不能把分子中的 2 直接替换为 $f(0)$，更不能据此写 $f'(0)=3$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：无法确定。</div></div>"},"calc-stage3-differential-0001":{"hint":"观察内层 $x^2$ 的导数是否出现在乘积中。利用复合函数求导逆向寻找原函数。求得原函数后，用 $x=0$ 的条件确定积分常数，再代入所求点。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：把 $2x$ 与内层 $x^2$ 的导数配对，识别复合函数的原函数；初值用于补回求导时消失的常数。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>由链式法则，$\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(x^2)=2x\\cos(x^2)$，所以 $f(x)=\\sin(x^2)+C$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>代入 $f(0)=1$ 得 $\\sin0+C=1$，故 $C=1$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>于是 $f(1)=\\sin(1^2)+1=1+\\sin1$。反求导并代入 $x=0$ 可同时验证导数条件与初值条件。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：只写 $\\sin1$ 会漏掉由初值确定的常数；只写 $1$ 是把 $f(0)$ 当作 $f(1)$；得到 $2$ 则把 $\\sin1$ 误当作 1。角度按弧度处理。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$1+\\sin1$。</div></div>"},"calc-stage3-integral-0001":{"hint":"观察分母 $1+x$ 与其导数的关系。在积分区间检查分母的符号，选择对数型原函数。最后按上限值减下限值计算。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：识别 $u'/u$ 型积分，在分母为正的区间用 $\\ln(1+x)$ 作原函数，再按定积分公式代入两端。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>在 $[0,1]$ 上 $1+x>0$，被积函数连续，且 $\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(1+x)=\\frac{1}{1+x}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由牛顿—莱布尼茨公式，$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\frac{dx}{1+x}=\\left[\\ln(1+x)\\right]_0^1=\\ln2-\\ln1=\\ln2$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>由于 $\\frac12\\le\\frac{1}{1+x}\\le1$，积分应介于 $\\frac12$ 与 1 之间，结果 $\\ln2$ 符合此范围。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：不能把 $1/(1+x)$ 当成常数积分而答 $1$，也不能直接代入分母而答 $2$。$e-1$ 来自误用指数函数的积分公式；本题需要对数，且 $\\ln1=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\ln2$。</div></div>"},"calc-stage3-multivariable-0001":{"hint":"先求两个偏导数并在给定点组成梯度。方向导数是梯度与单位方向向量的点积。用柯西不等式找上界，并检查何种方向能取到上界。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：求给定点的梯度，将所有单位方向上的方向导数写成点积；上界与取等方向一起验证才能确定最大值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>$f_x=2x$，$f_y=4y$，故 $\\nabla f(1,1)=(2,4)$。多项式函数可微，单位方向 $\\boldsymbol u$ 的方向导数为 $D_{\\boldsymbol u}f=\\nabla f\\cdot\\boldsymbol u$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>由柯西不等式及 $|\\boldsymbol u|=1$，$D_{\\boldsymbol u}f\\le|\\nabla f|=\\sqrt{2^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{20}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>当 $\\boldsymbol u=\\frac{(2,4)}{\\sqrt{20}}=(\\frac1{\\sqrt5},\\frac2{\\sqrt5})$ 时达到上界。因此最大值为 $\\sqrt{20}=2\\sqrt5$；反方向取得最小值 $-\\sqrt{20}$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：$2$、$4$ 只是坐标轴方向上的偏导数，未必是所有方向中的最大值；$20$ 是梯度模的平方，必须开方。方向向量要单位化，最大值取同向，反向取得最小值，不能把两者混同。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\sqrt{20}$。</div></div>"},"calc-stage3-double-integral-0001":{"hint":"先回忆被积函数恒为 1 的二重积分表示什么几何量。区分圆盘的半径、面积与圆周长。也可把区域写成极坐标范围，用面积元检验。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：先利用二重积分的面积意义直接求值，再用极坐标面积元作独立检验，确认圆盘覆盖范围。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>单位圆盘为 $D=\\{(x,y):x^2+y^2\\le1\\}$。常数函数 1 的二重积分等于区域面积，故值为 $\\pi\\cdot1^2=\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>用极坐标验证：$0\\le r\\le1$，$0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi$，$dA=r\\,dr\\,d\\theta$，因此 $\\iint_D1\\,dA=\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\int_0^1 r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=2\\pi\\cdot\\frac12=\\pi$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：$1$ 是半径而非面积；$2\\pi$ 是圆周长，也可能来自极坐标漏乘雅可比因子 $r$；$4\\pi$ 对应错误使用半径 2，需从区域条件确认半径为 1。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$\\pi$。</div></div>"},"calc-stage3-ode-0001":{"hint":"识别这是齐次一阶线性方程，并确定 $y$ 的系数。尝试乘一个积分因子，把左侧化为乘积的导数。积分后用初值定常数，最后代回原方程检查。","explain":"<div class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">思路</span><div><b>解题思路</b>：用积分因子把一阶线性方程化为乘积导数，求通解后用初值定常数；同时核对微分方程与初值。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><div>乘积分因子 $e^x$，得到 $e^xy'+e^xy=(e^xy)'=0$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><div>积分得 $e^xy=C$，即 $y=Ce^{-x}$，其中也包含 $C=0$ 的零解，无须除以 $y$。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><div>由 $y(0)=C=2$，得 $y=2e^{-x}$。代回有 $y'+y=-2e^{-x}+2e^{-x}=0$，初值亦满足；该解在全体实数上成立。</div></div><div class=\"solution-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">易错</span><div><b>易错点</b>：$2e^x$ 的增长方向与 $y'=-y$ 相反；$e^{-2x}$ 把初值 2 错放进指数，且初值为 1；$2-x$ 虽符合初值，却不满足原方程。分离变量若除以 $y$，须另检查零解。</div></div><div class=\"solution-conclusion\">答案：$2e^{-x}$。</div></div>"}};
